{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019eb3a5-07e3-7163-a098-145f9d55e5f3", "turn_id": "019ef2e8-99c7-78b3-9739-68d93a019e1c", "item_id": "item-305", "rollout_ordinal": 2548, "created_at_ms": 1782191794846, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 2548, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-305", "text": "Detenido. No sigo haciendo nada.", "phase": "final_answer", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019eb3a5-07e3-7163-a098-145f9d55e5f3", "turn_id": "019ef2ec-e394-76a2-ae8c-3abba539a18e", "item_id": "item-306", "rollout_ordinal": 2555, "created_at_ms": 1782192071658, "item_type": "userMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 2555, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "userMessage", "id": "item-306", "clientId": "4505d493-6f8e-4fc7-900b-bfd1b37daea9", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "\n# Files mentioned by the user:\n\n## Carta Gantt.xlsx: C:/Users/Diego Tapia/Desktop/Pene/U/13avo semestre/Formulación/Informe final/Documento/Carta Gantt.xlsx\n\n## Documento final.docx: C:/Users/Diego Tapia/Desktop/Pene/U/13avo semestre/Formulación/Informe final/Documento/Documento final.docx\n\n## Especificacion de Requisitos.docx: C:/Users/Diego Tapia/Desktop/Pene/U/13avo semestre/Formulación/Informe final/Documento/Especificacion de Requisitos.docx\n\n## Historias de Usuario.docx: C:/Users/Diego Tapia/Desktop/Pene/U/13avo semestre/Formulación/Informe final/Documento/Historias de Usuario.docx\n\n## Modelo de datos.png: C:/Users/Diego Tapia/Desktop/Pene/U/13avo semestre/Formulación/Informe final/Documento/Modelo de datos.png\n\n## My request for Codex:\nme equivoqué con los archivos, ignora los anteriores y haz de nuevo el analisis con estos \n", "text_elements": []}, {"type": "localImage", "detail": null, "path": "C:\\Users\\Diego Tapia\\Desktop\\Pene\\U\\13avo semestre\\Formulación\\Informe final\\Documento\\Modelo de datos.png"}]}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019eb3a5-07e3-7163-a098-145f9d55e5f3", "turn_id": "019ef2ec-e394-76a2-ae8c-3abba539a18e", "item_id": "item-307", "rollout_ordinal": 2557, "created_at_ms": 1782192087385, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 2557, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-307", "text": "Perfecto, tomo estos como la versión correcta y dejo fuera cualquier conclusión anterior que dependiera de otros archivos. Voy a revisar nuevamente el paquete completo: documento final, requisitos, historias, Gantt y modelo de datos.", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019eb3a5-07e3-7163-a098-145f9d55e5f3", "turn_id": "019ef2ec-e394-76a2-ae8c-3abba539a18e", "item_id": "item-308", "rollout_ordinal": 2567, "created_at_ms": 1782192131307, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 2567, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-308", "text": "El documento final sí cambió de hora y tamaño, así que vale la pena revisar de cero. El modelo de datos que recibí sigue mostrando tablas de ejemplo (`users`, `posts`, `follows`), pero voy a validar todo el resto antes de darte el diagnóstico final.", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019eb3a5-07e3-7163-a098-145f9d55e5f3", "turn_id": "019ef2ec-e394-76a2-ae8c-3abba539a18e", "item_id": "item-309", "rollout_ordinal": 2577, "created_at_ms": 1782192156611, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 2577, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-309", "text": "La versión nueva mejoró en algunos aspectos: ahora tiene 16 imágenes y 14 tablas, y el documento final está más completo. Voy a localizar los residuos exactos como `TODO` y la frase de figura para separar errores reales de palabras aceptables como “pendiente”.", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019eb3a5-07e3-7163-a098-145f9d55e5f3", "turn_id": "019ef2ec-e394-76a2-ae8c-3abba539a18e", "item_id": "item-310", "rollout_ordinal": 2587, "created_at_ms": 1782192184871, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 2587, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-310", "text": "Sí, ahora analicé esta versión nueva del paquete. El documento final cambió respecto a lo anterior, pero hay algunas observaciones que siguen siendo importantes.\n\n**Problemas A Corregir**\n1. En el modelo de datos todavía aparecen tablas ajenas al proyecto: `users`, `posts` y `follows`. Eso sí conviene eliminarlo antes de entregar, porque se ve como residuo de plantilla de dbdiagram.io.\n\n2. En [Documento final.docx](<C:\\Users\\Diego Tapia\\Desktop\\Pene\\U\\13avo semestre\\Formulación\\Informe final\\Documento\\Documento final.docx>) todavía aparece la frase:  \n   `La figura puede presentar el siguiente contenido:`  \n   Está justo después de la Figura 1.2. Hay que borrarla.\n\n3. El índice incluye `Resumen`, `Índice de figuras` e `Índice de tablas`, pero no aparecen desarrollados como secciones reales. Si no los vas a incluir ahora, mejor quitarlos del índice.\n\n4. El índice está manual y sin números de página. Para una entrega de avance puede pasar, pero visualmente quedaría más formal si al menos tuviera paginación.\n\n5. Hay archivos temporales de Word en la carpeta, por ejemplo `~$cumento final.docx`. No los incluyas en la entrega.\n\n**Inconsistencias A Revisar**\n- En la carta Gantt, `RNF15 Distribución` aparece como completado, pero en los requisitos se dice que el ejecutable queda pendiente de evaluación. Yo lo dejaría como `Parcial`, no `Completado`.\n\n- La Gantt tiene una tarea pendiente de “Definir modelo de datos y tecnología de persistencia”, pero ya estás entregando un modelo de datos. Podría quedar como “Refinar/validar modelo de datos y tecnología de persistencia”.\n\n- En el modelo de datos, la estructura principal sí tiene sentido, pero la imagen es demasiado ancha y pequeña para leerse bien en Word. Conviene exportarla recortada, sin tablas sobrantes y quizá en dos partes: núcleo del sistema y análisis/retroalimentación.\n\n- Las historias de usuario parecen estar bien en cantidad y contenido, pero revisa visualmente que las filas grandes estén fusionadas como en el formato. Internamente Word las lee duplicadas, aunque eso puede ser normal si son celdas fusionadas.\n\n**Lo Que Se Ve Bien**\n- El documento final tiene portada, índice, capítulos 1 a 4, referencias completas `[1]–[30]`, 16 imágenes y 14 tablas/cuadros.\n- Los requisitos están completos y ordenados: `RF01–RF29` y `RNF01–RNF16`, sin saltos.\n- La carta Gantt calza con el contexto de 30 semanas y corte en semana 15.\n- El avance declarado de requisitos es defendible: `16 de 45 = 35,6%`, superando el 30%.\n- Está bien explicado que LLM, ejecutable, interfaz final y persistencia definitiva quedan como decisiones abiertas.\n\nYo corregiría primero tres cosas: borrar `users/posts/follows` del modelo, eliminar la frase residual de la Figura 1.2 y ajustar `RNF15` a parcial. Con eso la entrega queda bastante más limpia.", "phase": "final_answer", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019eb3a5-07e3-7163-a098-145f9d55e5f3", "turn_id": "019ef303-2890-7ee1-87ba-5b4bc002b154", "item_id": "item-311", "rollout_ordinal": 2594, "created_at_ms": 1782193531119, "item_type": "userMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 2594, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "userMessage", "id": "item-311", "clientId": "8ad9b300-cd56-475d-b4d2-ce561b8a1787", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "okey, todo eso está ahora arreglado\n", "text_elements": []}]}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019eb3a5-07e3-7163-a098-145f9d55e5f3", "turn_id": "019ef303-2890-7ee1-87ba-5b4bc002b154", "item_id": "item-312", "rollout_ordinal": 2595, "created_at_ms": 1782193537196, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 2595, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-312", "text": "Buenísimo. Entonces, con esas correcciones, el paquete queda mucho más sólido: documento principal, requisitos, historias, Gantt y modelo de datos ya están alineados para una entrega de avance.\n\nAntes de enviar, haría solo una revisión final rápida: abrir el `.zip` o carpeta tal como lo vas a entregar, comprobar que no vayan archivos `~$...`, que el modelo de datos se lea bien al hacer zoom, y que el documento final tenga las figuras visibles. Por lo demás, la estructura ya se ve defendible.", "phase": "final_answer", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019eb3a5-07e3-7163-a098-145f9d55e5f3", "turn_id": "019ef303-9570-7253-99a5-e9c4a891d4ff", "item_id": "item-313", "rollout_ordinal": 2602, "created_at_ms": 1782193558982, "item_type": "userMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 2602, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "userMessage", "id": "item-313", "clientId": "d136ca5f-ac2a-4e27-8963-6d1b7b54f0a2", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "encuentras que no hace falta contenido?\n", "text_elements": []}]}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019eb3a5-07e3-7163-a098-145f9d55e5f3", "turn_id": "019ef303-9570-7253-99a5-e9c4a891d4ff", "item_id": "item-314", "rollout_ordinal": 2604, "created_at_ms": 1782193574898, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 2604, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-314", "text": "Para esta entrega, no siento que falte contenido de fondo. Para un avance de 30%, ya tienes lo esencial: contexto, problema, propuesta, objetivos, alcances, planificación, estado actual, marco/trabajo relacionado, metodología, desarrollo, arquitectura, requisitos, historias, Gantt y modelo de datos.\n\nLo único que revisaría como “faltante” sería más de forma que de contenido:\n\n- Un **resumen breve**, si lo vas a dejar en el índice.\n- Una frase en el documento diciendo que **requisitos, historias, Carta Gantt y modelo de datos se entregan como anexos/documentos complementarios**.\n- Una mini síntesis al final del capítulo 4 que deje claro: qué está implementado, qué queda pendiente y por qué eso calza con el 30%.\n- Si la pauta lo pide, índice de figuras/tablas; si no, no lo fuerces.\n\nNo agregaría capítulos nuevos ni más teoría por ahora. Meter más contenido podría hacer que se vea menos enfocado. Yo diría que ya está en una zona bastante defendible.", "phase": "final_answer", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019eb3a5-07e3-7163-a098-145f9d55e5f3", "turn_id": "019ef30e-5ec3-7d81-a175-b4fcd82bed83", "item_id": "item-315", "rollout_ordinal": 2611, "created_at_ms": 1782194265877, "item_type": "userMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 2611, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "userMessage", "id": "item-315", "clientId": "39d1d653-d122-4569-952d-256af97e8014", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "\n# Files mentioned by the user:\n\n## memoria.pdf: C:/Users/Diego Tapia/Desktop/Pene/U/13avo semestre/Formulación/Documento/Formato Memoria/memoria.pdf\n\n## My request for Codex:\nok, segun esto que nos falta?\n", "text_elements": []}]}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019eb3a5-07e3-7163-a098-145f9d55e5f3", "turn_id": "019ef30e-5ec3-7d81-a175-b4fcd82bed83", "item_id": "item-316", "rollout_ordinal": 2613, "created_at_ms": 1782194281795, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 2613, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-316", "text": "Voy a revisar el formato de memoria como pauta, no solo la portada. Me fijaré en la estructura obligatoria/preliminar y la compararé con lo que ya tienes armado para esta entrega.", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019eb3a5-07e3-7163-a098-145f9d55e5f3", "turn_id": "019ef30e-5ec3-7d81-a175-b4fcd82bed83", "item_id": "item-317", "rollout_ordinal": 2621, "created_at_ms": 1782194304932, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 2621, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-317", "text": "Según el formato de `memoria.pdf`, lo que te falta no es tanto contenido técnico, sino partes formales de memoria.\n\nPara la entrega actual, lo más relevante sería:\n\n- **Resumen**: está en el índice, pero no está desarrollado como sección. Deberías agregar una página breve con el resumen del proyecto.\n- **Índice de figuras**: el formato lo contempla. Como tienes muchas figuras, conviene incluirlo.\n- **Índice de tablas/cuadros**: también corresponde, porque tu documento tiene varios cuadros.\n- **Paginación del índice**: el formato muestra tabla de contenidos con números de página. Tu índice está bien como estructura, pero debería tener páginas si quieres que se vea más formal.\n- **Anexos integrados o bien referenciados**: tienes requisitos, historias, Carta Gantt y modelo de datos como archivos separados. Está bien para entrega, pero en el documento deberías decir explícitamente algo como: “Los anexos se entregan como documentos complementarios”. Para memoria final deberían ir integrados.\n- **Glosario**: el formato lo incluye. No es urgente, pero para tu tema podría servir mucho: pitch, F0, cents, DTW, stem, Demucs, LLM, segmento problemático, etc.\n- **Bibliografía/Referencias**: ya tienes referencias, pero el formato usa “Bibliografía”. Puedes mantener “Referencias” si tu profesor lo acepta, pero si quieres calzar con el formato, cámbialo a “Bibliografía”.\n\nPara memoria final, además faltarían partes que ahora no son necesarias: dedicatoria, agradecimientos, segunda portada con profesor informante y nota, capítulos de resultados/conclusiones, y anexos completos dentro del mismo documento.\n\nEn resumen: para esta entrega yo agregaría **Resumen**, **Índice de figuras**, **Índice de tablas/cuadros** y una nota clara sobre los **anexos/documentos complementarios**. El glosario es recomendable, pero no tan urgente.", "phase": "final_answer", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019eb3a5-07e3-7163-a098-145f9d55e5f3", "turn_id": "019ef312-2264-73e2-879e-4be75a0255f3", "item_id": "item-318", "rollout_ordinal": 2628, "created_at_ms": 1782194512559, "item_type": "userMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 2628, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "userMessage", "id": "item-318", "clientId": "c694bb25-25a5-4edd-9590-8aba12ac5255", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "ok, arregla lo del indice de figuras y tablas, así como tambien la referencia a los anexos y la paginación en el indice\n", "text_elements": []}]}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019eb3a5-07e3-7163-a098-145f9d55e5f3", "turn_id": "019ef312-2264-73e2-879e-4be75a0255f3", "item_id": "item-319", "rollout_ordinal": 2630, "created_at_ms": 1782194535440, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 2630, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-319", "text": "Voy a editar el documento principal, cuidando que el índice quede usable en Word. Para la paginación lo más limpio es dejar campos automáticos de Word para tabla de contenidos, índice de figuras e índice de tablas/cuadros, de modo que al abrirlo se actualicen con números de página reales.", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019eb3a5-07e3-7163-a098-145f9d55e5f3", "turn_id": "019ef312-2264-73e2-879e-4be75a0255f3", "item_id": "item-320", "rollout_ordinal": 2633, "created_at_ms": 1782194570259, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 2633, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-320", "text": "Voy a revisar si puedo apoyarme en Word/COM para actualizar campos automáticamente; si no, insertaré los campos de índice con actualización al abrir. También voy a detectar las leyendas reales de figuras/cuadros para que los índices no queden inventados.", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019eb3a5-07e3-7163-a098-145f9d55e5f3", "turn_id": "019ef312-2264-73e2-879e-4be75a0255f3", "item_id": "item-321", "rollout_ordinal": 2643, "created_at_ms": 1782194582561, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 2643, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-321", "text": "Detecté que `Documento final.docx` está abierto en Word. Eso en realidad ayuda: puedo usar Word para insertar índices reales con números de página, en vez de dejar campos “a medio actualizar”. Voy a trabajar sobre el documento abierto y guardar los cambios.", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019eb3a5-07e3-7163-a098-145f9d55e5f3", "turn_id": "019ef312-2264-73e2-879e-4be75a0255f3", "item_id": "item-322", "rollout_ordinal": 2649, "created_at_ms": 1782194682843, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 2649, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-322", "text": "Haré una copia de respaldo antes de tocarlo y luego reemplazaré el índice manual por uno paginado. También agregaré una sección real de “Anexos” al final con la lista de documentos complementarios, para que el índice no apunte a algo inexistente.", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019eb3a5-07e3-7163-a098-145f9d55e5f3", "turn_id": "019ef312-2264-73e2-879e-4be75a0255f3", "item_id": "call_CuY2KPh1wwck2ItH5KVJGG3V", "rollout_ordinal": 2652, "created_at_ms": 1782194741169, "item_type": "fileChange", "updated_at_ordinal": 2652, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "fileChange", "id": "call_CuY2KPh1wwck2ItH5KVJGG3V", "changes": [{"path": "C:\\Users\\Diego Tapia\\Desktop\\Pene\\U\\Tesis\\tesis_karaoke\\docs\\actualizar_indices_word.ps1", "kind": {"type": "add"}, "diff": "$ErrorActionPreference = \"Stop\"\n\n$root = \"C:\\Users\\Diego Tapia\\Desktop\\Pene\\U\\13avo semestre\"\n$form = Get-ChildItem -LiteralPath $root -Directory | Where-Object { $_.Name -like \"Formulaci*\" } | Select-Object -First 1\n$docPath = Join-Path $form.FullName \"Informe final\\Documento\\Documento final.docx\"\n$backupPath = Join-Path (Split-Path $docPath) (\"Documento final_backup_indices_{0}.docx\" -f (Get-Date -Format \"yyyyMMdd_HHmmss\"))\n\n$word = [Runtime.InteropServices.Marshal]::GetActiveObject(\"Word.Application\")\n$doc = $null\nfor ($i = 1; $i -le $word.Documents.Count; $i++) {\n    $candidate = $word.Documents.Item($i)\n    if ($candidate.FullName -eq $docPath) {\n        $doc = $candidate\n        break\n    }\n}\nif ($null -eq $doc) {\n    $doc = $word.Documents.Open($docPath)\n}\n\n$doc.SaveCopyAs($backupPath)\n\n$wdStory = 6\n$wdPageBreak = 7\n$wdActiveEndPageNumber = 3\n$wdStyleHeading1 = -2\n$wdStyleHeading2 = -3\n$wdStyleHeading3 = -4\n$wdStyleNormal = -1\n$wdAlignLeft = 0\n$wdAlignCenter = 1\n$wdAlignTabRight = 2\n$wdTabLeaderDots = 1\n\nfunction Clean-Text($text) {\n    return (($text -replace \"`r\", \"\") -replace \"`a\", \"\").Trim()\n}\n\nfunction Set-Paragraph-Font($paragraph, [double]$size = 12, [bool]$bold = $false, [int]$align = 0) {\n    $paragraph.Range.Font.Name = \"Times New Roman\"\n    $paragraph.Range.Font.Size = $size\n    $paragraph.Range.Font.Bold = $(if ($bold) { 1 } else { 0 })\n    $paragraph.Alignment = $align\n    $paragraph.SpaceAfter = 0\n    $paragraph.LineSpacingRule = 0\n}\n\nfunction Add-Entry($doc, $range, $text, $page, [int]$level = 0) {\n    $range.InsertAfter(\"$text`t$page`r\")\n    $p = $doc.Paragraphs.Item($doc.Paragraphs.Count)\n    Set-Paragraph-Font $p 12 $false $wdAlignLeft\n    $p.LeftIndent = $word.CentimetersToPoints(0.55 * $level)\n    $p.FirstLineIndent = 0\n    $p.TabStops.ClearAll()\n    $rightPos = $doc.PageSetup.PageWidth - $doc.PageSetup.LeftMargin - $doc.PageSetup.RightMargin\n    [void]$p.TabStops.Add($rightPos, $wdAlignTabRight, $wdTabLeaderDots)\n    return $doc.Range($p.Range.End, $p.Range.End)\n}\n\nfunction Add-Title($doc, $range, $text) {\n    $range.InsertAfter(\"$text`r\")\n    $p = $doc.Paragraphs.Item($doc.Paragraphs.Count)\n    Set-Paragraph-Font $p 14 $true $wdAlignCenter\n    return $doc.Range($p.Range.End, $p.Range.End)\n}\n\nfunction Add-Plain($doc, $range, $text) {\n    $range.InsertAfter(\"$text`r\")\n    $p = $doc.Paragraphs.Item($doc.Paragraphs.Count)\n    Set-Paragraph-Font $p 12 $false $wdAlignLeft\n    return $doc.Range($p.Range.End, $p.Range.End)\n}\n\nfunction Get-Paragraphs-After-ContentStart($doc) {\n    $introCount = 0\n    $startIndex = 0\n    for ($i = 1; $i -le $doc.Paragraphs.Count; $i++) {\n        $t = Clean-Text $doc.Paragraphs.Item($i).Range.Text\n        if ($t -eq \"1. Introducción\") {\n            $introCount += 1\n            if ($introCount -eq 1) {\n                $startIndex = $i\n                break\n            }\n        }\n    }\n    $items = @()\n    if ($startIndex -gt 0) {\n        for ($i = $startIndex; $i -le $doc.Paragraphs.Count; $i++) {\n            $items += $doc.Paragraphs.Item($i)\n        }\n    }\n    return $items\n}\n\nfunction Get-Indexable-Items($doc) {\n    $items = @()\n    foreach ($p in (Get-Paragraphs-After-ContentStart $doc)) {\n        $t = Clean-Text $p.Range.Text\n        if ($t -match \"^[1-4]\\. .+\") {\n            $items += [pscustomobject]@{ Text = $t; Level = 0; Page = $p.Range.Information($wdActiveEndPageNumber) }\n        } elseif ($t -match \"^[1-4]\\.[0-9]+\\. .+\") {\n            $items += [pscustomobject]@{ Text = $t; Level = 1; Page = $p.Range.Information($wdActiveEndPageNumber) }\n        } elseif ($t -match \"^[1-4]\\.[0-9]+\\.[0-9]+\\. .+\") {\n            $items += [pscustomobject]@{ Text = $t; Level = 2; Page = $p.Range.Information($wdActiveEndPageNumber) }\n        } elseif ($t -eq \"Referencias\" -or $t -eq \"Anexos\") {\n            $items += [pscustomobject]@{ Text = $t; Level = 0; Page = $p.Range.Information($wdActiveEndPageNumber) }\n        }\n    }\n    return $items\n}\n\nfunction Get-Caption-Items($doc, $kind) {\n    $items = @()\n    foreach ($p in (Get-Paragraphs-After-ContentStart $doc)) {\n        $t = Clean-Text $p.Range.Text\n        if ($kind -eq \"Figura\" -and $t -match \"^Figura\\s+\\d+(\\.\\d+)?:\") {\n            $label = ($t -replace \"\\.\\s*Fuente:.*$\", \"\")\n            $items += [pscustomobject]@{ Text = $label; Page = $p.Range.Information($wdActiveEndPageNumber) }\n        }\n        if ($kind -eq \"Cuadro\" -and $t -match \"^Cuadro\\s+\\d+(\\.\\d+)?:\") {\n            $label = ($t -replace \"\\.\\s*Fuente:.*$\", \"\")\n            $items += [pscustomobject]@{ Text = $label; Page = $p.Range.Information($wdActiveEndPageNumber) }\n        }\n    }\n    return $items\n}\n\nfunction Style-Document-Headings($doc) {\n    $contentStarted = $false\n    for ($i = 1; $i -le $doc.Paragraphs.Count; $i++) {\n        $p = $doc.Paragraphs.Item($i)\n        $t = Clean-Text $p.Range.Text\n        if ($t -eq \"1. Introducción\") {\n            $contentStarted = $true\n        }\n        if (-not $contentStarted) {\n            continue\n        }\n        if ($t -match \"^[1-4]\\. .+\" -or $t -eq \"Referencias\" -or $t -eq \"Anexos\") {\n            $p.Style = $doc.Styles.Item($wdStyleHeading1)\n        } elseif ($t -match \"^[1-4]\\.[0-9]+\\. .+\") {\n            $p.Style = $doc.Styles.Item($wdStyleHeading2)\n        } elseif ($t -match \"^[1-4]\\.[0-9]+\\.[0-9]+\\. .+\") {\n            $p.Style = $doc.Styles.Item($wdStyleHeading3)\n        }\n    }\n}\n\nfunction Ensure-Anexos($doc) {\n    $hasRealAnexos = $false\n    $contentStarted = $false\n    for ($i = 1; $i -le $doc.Paragraphs.Count; $i++) {\n        $t = Clean-Text $doc.Paragraphs.Item($i).Range.Text\n        if ($t -eq \"1. Introducción\") {\n            $contentStarted = $true\n        }\n        if ($contentStarted -and $t -eq \"Anexos\") {\n            $hasRealAnexos = $true\n        }\n    }\n    if (-not $hasRealAnexos) {\n        $end = $doc.Content.End - 1\n        $r = $doc.Range($end, $end)\n        $r.InsertBreak($wdPageBreak)\n        $r = $doc.Range($r.End, $r.End)\n        $text = \"Anexos`rLos anexos de esta entrega se presentan como documentos complementarios al documento principal. Estos artefactos respaldan la especificación, planificación y modelado del sistema desarrollado durante el primer semestre.`rAnexo A: Especificación de requisitos. Archivo: Especificacion de Requisitos.docx.`rAnexo B: Historias de usuario. Archivo: Historias de Usuario.docx.`rAnexo C: Carta Gantt. Archivo: Carta Gantt.xlsx.`rAnexo D: Modelo de datos. Archivo: Modelo de datos.png.`r\"\n        $r.InsertAfter($text)\n    }\n}\n\nfunction Remove-Old-Front-Index($doc) {\n    $start = $null\n    $contentStart = $null\n    $introCount = 0\n    for ($i = 1; $i -le $doc.Paragraphs.Count; $i++) {\n        $p = $doc.Paragraphs.Item($i)\n        $t = Clean-Text $p.Range.Text\n        if ($null -eq $start -and $t -eq \"TABLA DE CONTENIDOS\") {\n            $start = $p.Range.Start\n        }\n        if ($t -eq \"1. Introducción\") {\n            $introCount += 1\n            if ($introCount -eq 2) {\n                $contentStart = $p.Range.Start\n                break\n            }\n        }\n    }\n    if ($null -eq $start -or $null -eq $contentStart) {\n        throw \"No se pudo ubicar el índice manual o el inicio real del capítulo 1.\"\n    }\n    $doc.Range($start, $contentStart).Delete()\n    return $start\n}\n\nfunction Build-Front-Index($doc, $insertPos, $tocItems, $figItems, $tableItems) {\n    $r = $doc.Range($insertPos, $insertPos)\n    $r = Add-Title $doc $r \"TABLA DE CONTENIDOS\"\n    foreach ($item in $tocItems) {\n        $r = Add-Entry $doc $r $item.Text $item.Page $item.Level\n    }\n    $r.InsertBreak($wdPageBreak)\n    $r = $doc.Range($r.End, $r.End)\n\n    $r = Add-Title $doc $r \"ÍNDICE DE FIGURAS\"\n    foreach ($item in $figItems) {\n        $r = Add-Entry $doc $r $item.Text $item.Page 0\n    }\n    $r.InsertBreak($wdPageBreak)\n    $r = $doc.Range($r.End, $r.End)\n\n    $r = Add-Title $doc $r \"ÍNDICE DE TABLAS\"\n    foreach ($item in $tableItems) {\n        $r = Add-Entry $doc $r $item.Text $item.Page 0\n    }\n    $r.InsertBreak($wdPageBreak)\n}\n\nfunction Rebuild-With-Current-Pages($doc, $insertPos) {\n    $doc.Repaginate()\n    $tocItems = Get-Indexable-Items $doc\n    $figItems = Get-Caption-Items $doc \"Figura\"\n    $tableItems = Get-Caption-Items $doc \"Cuadro\"\n\n    $contentStart = $null\n    for ($i = 1; $i -le $doc.Paragraphs.Count; $i++) {\n        if ((Clean-Text $doc.Paragraphs.Item($i).Range.Text) -eq \"1. Introducción\") {\n            $contentStart = $doc.Paragraphs.Item($i).Range.Start\n            break\n        }\n    }\n    $doc.Range($insertPos, $contentStart).Delete()\n    Build-Front-Index $doc $insertPos $tocItems $figItems $tableItems\n    $doc.Repaginate()\n}\n\nEnsure-Anexos $doc\nStyle-Document-Headings $doc\n$insertPos = Remove-Old-Front-Index $doc\n\n$placeholderToc = Get-Indexable-Items $doc | ForEach-Object { [pscustomobject]@{ Text = $_.Text; Level = $_.Level; Page = 0 } }\n$placeholderFig = Get-Caption-Items $doc \"Figura\" | ForEach-Object { [pscustomobject]@{ Text = $_.Text; Page = 0 } }\n$placeholderTables = Get-Caption-Items $doc \"Cuadro\" | ForEach-Object { [pscustomobject]@{ Text = $_.Text; Page = 0 } }\nBuild-Front-Index $doc $insertPos $placeholderToc $placeholderFig $placeholderTables\n\nRebuild-With-Current-Pages $doc $insertPos\nRebuild-With-Current-Pages $doc $insertPos\n\nStyle-Document-Headings $doc\n$doc.Save()\n\nWrite-Output \"Documento actualizado: $docPath\"\nWrite-Output \"Respaldo creado: $backupPath\"\n"}], "status": "completed"}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019eb3a5-07e3-7163-a098-145f9d55e5f3", "turn_id": "019ef312-2264-73e2-879e-4be75a0255f3", "item_id": "item-323", "rollout_ordinal": 2656, "created_at_ms": 1782194744411, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 2656, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-323", "text": "Ya está listo el script de actualización. Lo ejecuto ahora sobre el documento abierto, con respaldo automático antes de guardar.", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019eb3a5-07e3-7163-a098-145f9d55e5f3", "turn_id": "019ef312-2264-73e2-879e-4be75a0255f3", "item_id": "item-324", "rollout_ordinal": 2662, "created_at_ms": 1782194882180, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 2662, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-324", "text": "El proceso se demoró más de lo esperado y el comando alcanzó el límite de tiempo. Voy a revisar si Word guardó parte de los cambios o si quedó esperando algo, para no pisar el documento a ciegas.", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019eb3a5-07e3-7163-a098-145f9d55e5f3", "turn_id": "019ef312-2264-73e2-879e-4be75a0255f3", "item_id": "item-325", "rollout_ordinal": 2672, "created_at_ms": 1782194891294, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 2672, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-325", "text": "Todavía hay un proceso de PowerShell trabajando con Word, con CPU activa. Voy a darle un momento corto más; si no termina, lo detengo y uso un método más directo con `python-docx`, que no depende del maquetado vivo de Word.", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019eb3a5-07e3-7163-a098-145f9d55e5f3", "turn_id": "019ef312-2264-73e2-879e-4be75a0255f3", "item_id": "item-326", "rollout_ordinal": 2678, "created_at_ms": 1782194913310, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 2678, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-326", "text": "Ese proceso quedó girando demasiado, así que lo voy a detener para no arriesgar el archivo. Como no alcanzó a guardar cambios, aplicaré una versión más simple y controlada: índices editables con paginación aproximada/estructural desde Word, y una sección de anexos real.", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019eb3a5-07e3-7163-a098-145f9d55e5f3", "turn_id": "019ef312-2264-73e2-879e-4be75a0255f3", "item_id": "item-327", "rollout_ordinal": 2684, "created_at_ms": 1782194928876, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 2684, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-327", "text": "Antes de seguir, voy a comprobar si Word quedó con cambios sin guardar por el intento anterior. Si quedó sucio, lo más prudente es revertir solo ese intento y trabajar sobre el archivo guardado.", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019eb3a5-07e3-7163-a098-145f9d55e5f3", "turn_id": "019ef312-2264-73e2-879e-4be75a0255f3", "item_id": "item-328", "rollout_ordinal": 2690, "created_at_ms": 1782194944202, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 2690, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-328", "text": "Word marca el documento como guardado, pero el número de párrafos cambió, así que el intento anterior sí alcanzó a tocar algo. Voy a inspeccionar el archivo guardado para ver exactamente qué quedó antes de hacer cualquier corrección encima.", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019eb3a5-07e3-7163-a098-145f9d55e5f3", "turn_id": "019ef312-2264-73e2-879e-4be75a0255f3", "item_id": "item-329", "rollout_ordinal": 2698, "created_at_ms": 1782194976084, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 2698, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-329", "text": "Voy a cerrar solo `Documento final.docx` desde Word sin guardar el estado raro que dejó el intento anterior. El archivo en disco sigue intacto, y después trabajaré sobre una copia respaldada con campos automáticos de Word.", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019eb3a5-07e3-7163-a098-145f9d55e5f3", "turn_id": "019ef312-2264-73e2-879e-4be75a0255f3", "item_id": "item-330", "rollout_ordinal": 2704, "created_at_ms": 1782195010736, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 2704, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-330", "text": "Ahora cambio de estrategia: usaré `python-docx` para insertar campos de Word (`TOC`) y marcas internas para figuras/cuadros. Luego Word solo tendrá que actualizar campos, que es mucho más liviano que construir todo manualmente por COM.", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019eb3a5-07e3-7163-a098-145f9d55e5f3", "turn_id": "019ef312-2264-73e2-879e-4be75a0255f3", "item_id": "call_XH6CRJmhXoX6BSM4nP4k0MTa", "rollout_ordinal": 2707, "created_at_ms": 1782195052204, "item_type": "fileChange", "updated_at_ordinal": 2707, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "fileChange", "id": "call_XH6CRJmhXoX6BSM4nP4k0MTa", "changes": [{"path": "C:\\Users\\Diego Tapia\\Desktop\\Pene\\U\\Tesis\\tesis_karaoke\\docs\\preparar_indices_docx.py", "kind": {"type": "add"}, "diff": "from copy import deepcopy\nfrom pathlib import Path\n\nfrom docx import Document\nfrom docx.enum.text import WD_ALIGN_PARAGRAPH, WD_BREAK\nfrom docx.oxml import OxmlElement\nfrom docx.oxml.ns import qn\nfrom docx.shared import Pt\n\n\nROOT = Path(r\"C:\\Users\\Diego Tapia\\Desktop\\Pene\\U\\13avo semestre\")\nFORM = next(ROOT.glob(\"Formulaci*\"))\nDOC_PATH = FORM / \"Informe final\" / \"Documento\" / \"Documento final.docx\"\nBACKUP_PATH = DOC_PATH.with_name(\"Documento final_backup_antes_indices.docx\")\n\n\ndef clean(text: str) -> str:\n    return text.replace(\"\\r\", \"\").replace(\"\\x07\", \"\").strip()\n\n\ndef set_font(paragraph, size=12, bold=False, align=None):\n    if align is not None:\n        paragraph.alignment = align\n    paragraph.paragraph_format.space_after = Pt(0)\n    for run in paragraph.runs:\n        run.font.name = \"Times New Roman\"\n        run._element.rPr.rFonts.set(qn(\"w:eastAsia\"), \"Times New Roman\")\n        run.font.size = Pt(size)\n        run.bold = bold\n\n\ndef add_complex_field(paragraph, instruction: str, placeholder: str = \"\"):\n    run = paragraph.add_run()\n    fld_begin = OxmlElement(\"w:fldChar\")\n    fld_begin.set(qn(\"w:fldCharType\"), \"begin\")\n    run._r.append(fld_begin)\n\n    run = paragraph.add_run()\n    instr = OxmlElement(\"w:instrText\")\n    instr.set(qn(\"xml:space\"), \"preserve\")\n    instr.text = instruction\n    run._r.append(instr)\n\n    run = paragraph.add_run()\n    fld_separate = OxmlElement(\"w:fldChar\")\n    fld_separate.set(qn(\"w:fldCharType\"), \"separate\")\n    run._r.append(fld_separate)\n\n    if placeholder:\n        run = paragraph.add_run(placeholder)\n        run.font.name = \"Times New Roman\"\n        run.font.size = Pt(11)\n\n    run = paragraph.add_run()\n    fld_end = OxmlElement(\"w:fldChar\")\n    fld_end.set(qn(\"w:fldCharType\"), \"end\")\n    run._r.append(fld_end)\n\n\ndef add_tc_field(paragraph, text: str, table_id: str):\n    safe = text.replace('\"', \"'\")\n    run = paragraph.add_run()\n    fld = OxmlElement(\"w:fldSimple\")\n    fld.set(qn(\"w:instr\"), f'TC \"{safe}\" \\\\f {table_id}')\n    run._r.append(fld)\n\n\ndef add_update_fields_on_open(document):\n    settings = document.settings.element\n    for child in settings.findall(qn(\"w:updateFields\")):\n        settings.remove(child)\n    update = OxmlElement(\"w:updateFields\")\n    update.set(qn(\"w:val\"), \"true\")\n    settings.append(update)\n\n\ndef insert_paragraph_at(document, body_index: int, text: str = \"\", style=None):\n    paragraph = document.add_paragraph(text)\n    if style:\n        paragraph.style = style\n    p = paragraph._p\n    document.element.body.remove(p)\n    document.element.body.insert(body_index, p)\n    return paragraph\n\n\ndef find_manual_index_bounds(document):\n    start_para = None\n    content_para = None\n    intro_count = 0\n    for paragraph in document.paragraphs:\n        text = clean(paragraph.text)\n        if start_para is None and text == \"TABLA DE CONTENIDOS\":\n            start_para = paragraph\n        if text == \"1. Introducción\":\n            intro_count += 1\n            if intro_count == 2:\n                content_para = paragraph\n                break\n    if start_para is None or content_para is None:\n        raise RuntimeError(\"No se pudo ubicar el índice manual o el inicio real del capítulo 1.\")\n\n    body = document.element.body\n    return body.index(start_para._p), body.index(content_para._p)\n\n\ndef remove_body_range(document, start_idx, end_idx):\n    body = document.element.body\n    for idx in range(end_idx - 1, start_idx - 1, -1):\n        body.remove(body[idx])\n\n\ndef style_content_headings(document):\n    content_started = False\n    for paragraph in document.paragraphs:\n        text = clean(paragraph.text)\n        if text == \"1. Introducción\":\n            content_started = True\n        if not content_started:\n            continue\n\n        if text in {\n            \"1. Introducción\",\n            \"2. Marco teórico y trabajo relacionado\",\n            \"3. Metodología\",\n            \"4. Desarrollo\",\n            \"Referencias\",\n            \"Anexos\",\n        }:\n            paragraph.style = \"Heading 1\"\n        elif any(text.startswith(f\"{chapter}.\") for chapter in [\"1\", \"2\", \"3\", \"4\"]) and text.count(\".\") >= 2:\n            if text.split(\" \", 1)[0].count(\".\") == 2:\n                paragraph.style = \"Heading 2\"\n            elif text.split(\" \", 1)[0].count(\".\") == 3:\n                paragraph.style = \"Heading 3\"\n\n\ndef has_real_anexos(document):\n    content_started = False\n    for paragraph in document.paragraphs:\n        text = clean(paragraph.text)\n        if text == \"1. Introducción\":\n            content_started = True\n        if content_started and text == \"Anexos\":\n            return True\n    return False\n\n\ndef ensure_anexos_section(document):\n    if has_real_anexos(document):\n        return\n    document.add_page_break()\n    heading = document.add_paragraph(\"Anexos\", style=\"Heading 1\")\n    set_font(heading, size=14, bold=True)\n    paragraphs = [\n        \"Los anexos de esta entrega se presentan como documentos complementarios al documento principal. Estos artefactos respaldan la especificación, planificación y modelado del sistema desarrollado durante el primer semestre.\",\n        \"Anexo A: Especificación de requisitos. Archivo: Especificacion de Requisitos.docx.\",\n        \"Anexo B: Historias de usuario. Archivo: Historias de Usuario.docx.\",\n        \"Anexo C: Carta Gantt. Archivo: Carta Gantt.xlsx.\",\n        \"Anexo D: Modelo de datos. Archivo: Modelo de datos.png.\",\n    ]\n    for text in paragraphs:\n        paragraph = document.add_paragraph(text)\n        set_font(paragraph, size=12)\n\n\ndef add_caption_tc_fields(document):\n    for paragraph in document.paragraphs:\n        text = clean(paragraph.text)\n        if text.startswith(\"Figura \"):\n            label = text.split(\". Fuente:\", 1)[0]\n            add_tc_field(paragraph, label, \"F\")\n        elif text.startswith(\"Cuadro \"):\n            label = text.split(\". Fuente:\", 1)[0]\n            add_tc_field(paragraph, label, \"T\")\n\n\ndef insert_front_indices(document, insert_idx):\n    body_index = insert_idx\n\n    title = insert_paragraph_at(document, body_index, \"TABLA DE CONTENIDOS\")\n    set_font(title, size=14, bold=True, align=WD_ALIGN_PARAGRAPH.CENTER)\n    body_index += 1\n\n    toc = insert_paragraph_at(document, body_index)\n    add_complex_field(toc, 'TOC \\\\o \"1-3\" \\\\h \\\\z \\\\u', \"Actualizar tabla de contenidos\")\n    set_font(toc, size=12)\n    body_index += 1\n\n    br = insert_paragraph_at(document, body_index)\n    br.add_run().add_break(WD_BREAK.PAGE)\n    body_index += 1\n\n    fig_title = insert_paragraph_at(document, body_index, \"ÍNDICE DE FIGURAS\")\n    set_font(fig_title, size=14, bold=True, align=WD_ALIGN_PARAGRAPH.CENTER)\n    body_index += 1\n\n    fig_index = insert_paragraph_at(document, body_index)\n    add_complex_field(fig_index, \"TOC \\\\f F \\\\h \\\\z\", \"Actualizar índice de figuras\")\n    set_font(fig_index, size=12)\n    body_index += 1\n\n    br = insert_paragraph_at(document, body_index)\n    br.add_run().add_break(WD_BREAK.PAGE)\n    body_index += 1\n\n    table_title = insert_paragraph_at(document, body_index, \"ÍNDICE DE TABLAS\")\n    set_font(table_title, size=14, bold=True, align=WD_ALIGN_PARAGRAPH.CENTER)\n    body_index += 1\n\n    table_index = insert_paragraph_at(document, body_index)\n    add_complex_field(table_index, \"TOC \\\\f T \\\\h \\\\z\", \"Actualizar índice de tablas\")\n    set_font(table_index, size=12)\n    body_index += 1\n\n    br = insert_paragraph_at(document, body_index)\n    br.add_run().add_break(WD_BREAK.PAGE)\n\n\ndef main():\n    if not BACKUP_PATH.exists():\n        BACKUP_PATH.write_bytes(DOC_PATH.read_bytes())\n\n    document = Document(str(DOC_PATH))\n    ensure_anexos_section(document)\n    style_content_headings(document)\n    add_caption_tc_fields(document)\n    add_update_fields_on_open(document)\n\n    start_idx, end_idx = find_manual_index_bounds(document)\n    remove_body_range(document, start_idx, end_idx)\n    insert_front_indices(document, start_idx)\n\n    document.save(str(DOC_PATH))\n    print(DOC_PATH)\n    print(BACKUP_PATH)\n\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    main()\n"}], "status": "completed"}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019eb3a5-07e3-7163-a098-145f9d55e5f3", "turn_id": "019ef312-2264-73e2-879e-4be75a0255f3", "item_id": "item-331", "rollout_ordinal": 2711, "created_at_ms": 1782195056324, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 2711, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-331", "text": "Voy a aplicar esta versión controlada al `.docx`. Después abriré Word solo para actualizar los campos y guardar los números de página.", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019eb3a5-07e3-7163-a098-145f9d55e5f3", "turn_id": "019ef312-2264-73e2-879e-4be75a0255f3", "item_id": "item-332", "rollout_ordinal": 2717, "created_at_ms": 1782195069068, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 2717, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-332", "text": "El documento ya tiene los campos insertados y la sección de anexos. Ahora falta que Word actualice esos campos para que aparezcan las páginas reales.", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019eb3a5-07e3-7163-a098-145f9d55e5f3", "turn_id": "019ef312-2264-73e2-879e-4be75a0255f3", "item_id": "item-333", "rollout_ordinal": 2725, "created_at_ms": 1782195089361, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 2725, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-333", "text": "Encontré un detalle: como el índice viejo todavía tenía la palabra “Anexos”, el script pensó que ya existía una sección real y no la agregó al final. Lo corrijo ahora agregando esa sección después de las referencias y luego actualizo los campos.", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019eb3a5-07e3-7163-a098-145f9d55e5f3", "turn_id": "019ef312-2264-73e2-879e-4be75a0255f3", "item_id": "item-334", "rollout_ordinal": 2731, "created_at_ms": 1782195108839, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 2731, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-334", "text": "La sección real de anexos ya quedó añadida. Ahora abro el documento con Word en segundo plano, actualizo todos los campos de índice y guardo.", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019eb3a5-07e3-7163-a098-145f9d55e5f3", "turn_id": "019ef312-2264-73e2-879e-4be75a0255f3", "item_id": "item-335", "rollout_ordinal": 2737, "created_at_ms": 1782195248069, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 2737, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-335", "text": "Word volvió a tardarse más de lo razonable al actualizar campos. Voy a revisar si quedó bloqueado por el campo de índices; si es así, evito la actualización automática y dejo los índices como campos actualizables al abrir, que Word puede resolver desde la interfaz con clic derecho o con F9.", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019eb3a5-07e3-7163-a098-145f9d55e5f3", "turn_id": "019ef312-2264-73e2-879e-4be75a0255f3", "item_id": "item-336", "rollout_ordinal": 2747, "created_at_ms": 1782195272646, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 2747, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-336", "text": "Word quedó ocupado actualizando campos y no respondió a la consulta COM. Detendré Word para liberar el archivo, que ya quedó guardado con los campos y anexos, y revisaré una alternativa para materializar las páginas sin depender de esa actualización.", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019eb3a5-07e3-7163-a098-145f9d55e5f3", "turn_id": "019ef312-2264-73e2-879e-4be75a0255f3", "item_id": "item-337", "rollout_ordinal": 2755, "created_at_ms": 1782195278919, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 2755, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-337", "text": "No hay LibreOffice/Pandoc disponible para actualizar campos fuera de Word. Entonces voy a dejar una solución robusta en el `.docx`: índices automáticos listos para actualizar al abrir, y además validaré que la estructura quede limpia y que la sección de anexos exista.", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019eb3a5-07e3-7163-a098-145f9d55e5f3", "turn_id": "019ef312-2264-73e2-879e-4be75a0255f3", "item_id": "item-338", "rollout_ordinal": 2758, "created_at_ms": 1782195291682, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 2758, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-338", "text": "Antes de decidir si conviene mantener campos automáticos o volver a índice manual, revisaré el XML del documento para confirmar que los campos `TOC` y las marcas de figuras/cuadros quedaron bien formados.", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019eb3a5-07e3-7163-a098-145f9d55e5f3", "turn_id": "019ef312-2264-73e2-879e-4be75a0255f3", "item_id": "item-339", "rollout_ordinal": 2764, "created_at_ms": 1782195301300, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 2764, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-339", "text": "Los campos están bien formados: hay 3 campos `TOC` y 27 marcas internas para figuras/cuadros. Voy a quitar la actualización automática al abrir para evitar que Word intente resolverlo apenas abras el archivo; después generaré una versión alternativa con índices manuales sin depender de campos si hace falta.", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019eb3a5-07e3-7163-a098-145f9d55e5f3", "turn_id": "019ef312-2264-73e2-879e-4be75a0255f3", "item_id": "item-340", "rollout_ordinal": 2767, "created_at_ms": 1782195324769, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 2767, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-340", "text": "Cambio a una solución manual paginada, que es más estable para este archivo: primero dejo índices con la misma cantidad de entradas y páginas temporales, luego Word solo calculará el número de página de cada encabezado/leyenda, sin actualizar campos.", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019eb3a5-07e3-7163-a098-145f9d55e5f3", "turn_id": "019ef312-2264-73e2-879e-4be75a0255f3", "item_id": "item-341", "rollout_ordinal": 2773, "created_at_ms": 1782195331633, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 2773, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-341", "text": "Word está cerrado, así que puedo rearmar el índice sin pelear con el archivo abierto. Ahora genero los índices manuales con marcadores de página, limpios y sin campos automáticos.", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019eb3a5-07e3-7163-a098-145f9d55e5f3", "turn_id": "019ef312-2264-73e2-879e-4be75a0255f3", "item_id": "call_cN7GABw3VIF0EHKWHqfvkA7M", "rollout_ordinal": 2776, "created_at_ms": 1782195366886, "item_type": "fileChange", "updated_at_ordinal": 2776, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "fileChange", "id": "call_cN7GABw3VIF0EHKWHqfvkA7M", "changes": [{"path": "C:\\Users\\Diego Tapia\\Desktop\\Pene\\U\\Tesis\\tesis_karaoke\\docs\\preparar_indices_manuales.py", "kind": {"type": "add"}, "diff": "from pathlib import Path\n\nfrom docx import Document\nfrom docx.enum.text import WD_ALIGN_PARAGRAPH, WD_BREAK, WD_TAB_ALIGNMENT, WD_TAB_LEADER\nfrom docx.oxml.ns import qn\nfrom docx.shared import Cm, Pt\n\n\nROOT = Path(r\"C:\\Users\\Diego Tapia\\Desktop\\Pene\\U\\13avo semestre\")\nFORM = next(ROOT.glob(\"Formulaci*\"))\nDOC_PATH = FORM / \"Informe final\" / \"Documento\" / \"Documento final.docx\"\n\n\ndef clean(text: str) -> str:\n    return text.replace(\"\\r\", \"\").replace(\"\\x07\", \"\").strip()\n\n\ndef set_font(paragraph, size=12, bold=False, align=None):\n    if align is not None:\n        paragraph.alignment = align\n    paragraph.paragraph_format.space_after = Pt(0)\n    paragraph.paragraph_format.line_spacing = 1.0\n    for run in paragraph.runs:\n        run.font.name = \"Times New Roman\"\n        run._element.rPr.rFonts.set(qn(\"w:eastAsia\"), \"Times New Roman\")\n        run.font.size = Pt(size)\n        run.bold = bold\n\n\ndef remove_tc_fields(document):\n    for paragraph in document.paragraphs:\n        for fld in list(paragraph._p.xpath(\".//w:fldSimple\")):\n            parent = fld.getparent()\n            parent.remove(fld)\n\n\ndef remove_update_fields_on_open(document):\n    settings = document.settings.element\n    for child in list(settings.findall(qn(\"w:updateFields\"))):\n        settings.remove(child)\n\n\ndef find_front_bounds(document):\n    start = None\n    content = None\n    for paragraph in document.paragraphs:\n        text = clean(paragraph.text)\n        if start is None and text == \"TABLA DE CONTENIDOS\":\n            start = paragraph\n        elif start is not None and text == \"1. Introducción\":\n            content = paragraph\n            break\n    if start is None or content is None:\n        raise RuntimeError(\"No se pudo ubicar el índice frontal o el inicio del capítulo 1.\")\n    body = document.element.body\n    return body.index(start._p), body.index(content._p)\n\n\ndef remove_body_range(document, start_idx, end_idx):\n    body = document.element.body\n    for idx in range(end_idx - 1, start_idx - 1, -1):\n        body.remove(body[idx])\n\n\ndef insert_paragraph_at(document, body_index, text=\"\", style=None):\n    paragraph = document.add_paragraph(text)\n    if style:\n        paragraph.style = style\n    p = paragraph._p\n    document.element.body.remove(p)\n    document.element.body.insert(body_index, p)\n    return paragraph\n\n\ndef iter_content_paragraphs(document):\n    started = False\n    for paragraph in document.paragraphs:\n        text = clean(paragraph.text)\n        if text == \"1. Introducción\":\n            started = True\n        if started:\n            yield paragraph\n\n\ndef heading_level(text):\n    if text in {\n        \"1. Introducción\",\n        \"2. Marco teórico y trabajo relacionado\",\n        \"3. Metodología\",\n        \"4. Desarrollo\",\n        \"Referencias\",\n        \"Anexos\",\n    }:\n        return 0\n    token = text.split(\" \", 1)[0]\n    if token.startswith((\"1.\", \"2.\", \"3.\", \"4.\")):\n        dot_count = token.count(\".\")\n        if dot_count == 2:\n            return 1\n        if dot_count == 3:\n            return 2\n    return None\n\n\ndef style_headings(document):\n    for paragraph in iter_content_paragraphs(document):\n        text = clean(paragraph.text)\n        level = heading_level(text)\n        if level == 0:\n            paragraph.style = \"Heading 1\"\n        elif level == 1:\n            paragraph.style = \"Heading 2\"\n        elif level == 2:\n            paragraph.style = \"Heading 3\"\n\n\ndef collect_items(document):\n    toc_items = []\n    fig_items = []\n    table_items = []\n    for paragraph in iter_content_paragraphs(document):\n        text = clean(paragraph.text)\n        level = heading_level(text)\n        if level is not None:\n            toc_items.append((text, level))\n        elif text.startswith(\"Figura \"):\n            fig_items.append(text.split(\". Fuente:\", 1)[0])\n        elif text.startswith(\"Cuadro \"):\n            table_items.append(text.split(\". Fuente:\", 1)[0])\n    return toc_items, fig_items, table_items\n\n\ndef ensure_anexos(document):\n    if any(clean(p.text) == \"Anexos\" for p in iter_content_paragraphs(document)):\n        return\n    document.add_page_break()\n    heading = document.add_paragraph(\"Anexos\", style=\"Heading 1\")\n    set_font(heading, size=14, bold=True)\n    texts = [\n        \"Los anexos de esta entrega se presentan como documentos complementarios al documento principal. Estos artefactos respaldan la especificación, planificación y modelado del sistema desarrollado durante el primer semestre.\",\n        \"Anexo A: Especificación de requisitos. Archivo: Especificacion de Requisitos.docx.\",\n        \"Anexo B: Historias de usuario. Archivo: Historias de Usuario.docx.\",\n        \"Anexo C: Carta Gantt. Archivo: Carta Gantt.xlsx.\",\n        \"Anexo D: Modelo de datos. Archivo: Modelo de datos.png.\",\n    ]\n    for text in texts:\n        paragraph = document.add_paragraph(text)\n        set_font(paragraph)\n\n\ndef add_title(document, idx, text):\n    paragraph = insert_paragraph_at(document, idx, text)\n    set_font(paragraph, size=14, bold=True, align=WD_ALIGN_PARAGRAPH.CENTER)\n    return idx + 1\n\n\ndef add_entry(document, idx, text, page, level=0):\n    paragraph = insert_paragraph_at(document, idx, f\"{text}\\t{page}\")\n    set_font(paragraph, size=12)\n    paragraph.paragraph_format.left_indent = Cm(0.55 * level)\n    paragraph.paragraph_format.tab_stops.clear_all()\n    paragraph.paragraph_format.tab_stops.add_tab_stop(\n        Cm(15.5), WD_TAB_ALIGNMENT.RIGHT, WD_TAB_LEADER.DOTS\n    )\n    return idx + 1\n\n\ndef add_page_break(document, idx):\n    paragraph = insert_paragraph_at(document, idx)\n    paragraph.add_run().add_break(WD_BREAK.PAGE)\n    return idx + 1\n\n\ndef build_front(document, insert_idx, toc_items, fig_items, table_items, pages=None):\n    pages = pages or {}\n    idx = insert_idx\n    idx = add_title(document, idx, \"TABLA DE CONTENIDOS\")\n    for text, level in toc_items:\n        idx = add_entry(document, idx, text, pages.get((\"toc\", text), \"0\"), level)\n    idx = add_page_break(document, idx)\n\n    idx = add_title(document, idx, \"ÍNDICE DE FIGURAS\")\n    for text in fig_items:\n        idx = add_entry(document, idx, text, pages.get((\"fig\", text), \"0\"), 0)\n    idx = add_page_break(document, idx)\n\n    idx = add_title(document, idx, \"ÍNDICE DE TABLAS\")\n    for text in table_items:\n        idx = add_entry(document, idx, text, pages.get((\"tab\", text), \"0\"), 0)\n    idx = add_page_break(document, idx)\n\n\ndef main():\n    document = Document(str(DOC_PATH))\n    remove_update_fields_on_open(document)\n    remove_tc_fields(document)\n    ensure_anexos(document)\n    style_headings(document)\n    toc_items, fig_items, table_items = collect_items(document)\n    start_idx, end_idx = find_front_bounds(document)\n    remove_body_range(document, start_idx, end_idx)\n    build_front(document, start_idx, toc_items, fig_items, table_items)\n    document.save(str(DOC_PATH))\n    print(DOC_PATH)\n    print(len(toc_items), len(fig_items), len(table_items))\n\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    main()\n"}], "status": "completed"}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019eb3a5-07e3-7163-a098-145f9d55e5f3", "turn_id": "019ef312-2264-73e2-879e-4be75a0255f3", "item_id": "item-342", "rollout_ordinal": 2779, "created_at_ms": 1782195370954, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 2779, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-342", "text": "Ejecutaré el armado manual con páginas temporales y luego usaré Word solo para leer números de página. Ese paso no actualiza campos ni modifica contenido, así que debería ser bastante más estable.", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019eb3a5-07e3-7163-a098-145f9d55e5f3", "turn_id": "019ef312-2264-73e2-879e-4be75a0255f3", "item_id": "item-343", "rollout_ordinal": 2791, "created_at_ms": 1782195397782, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 2791, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-343", "text": "Los índices ya están estructurados y ocupan páginas reales, todavía con marcador `0`. Ahora calculo las páginas con Word sin actualizar campos, solo leyendo la posición de cada encabezado y leyenda.", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019eb3a5-07e3-7163-a098-145f9d55e5f3", "turn_id": "019ef312-2264-73e2-879e-4be75a0255f3", "item_id": "item-344", "rollout_ordinal": 2797, "created_at_ms": 1782195476424, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 2797, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-344", "text": "Incluso solo calcular páginas con Word quedó lento en este entorno. Lo detengo para no dejar procesos colgados. El documento ya está funcionalmente armado, pero la paginación automática desde Word no está siendo confiable desde aquí.", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019eb3a5-07e3-7163-a098-145f9d55e5f3", "turn_id": "019ef312-2264-73e2-879e-4be75a0255f3", "item_id": "item-345", "rollout_ordinal": 2805, "created_at_ms": 1782195482677, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 2805, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-345", "text": "Listo, no debería quedar Word colgado. Voy a hacer una última limpieza del texto de anexos y dejar el documento en un estado entregable, con índices creados; las páginas del índice quedan como marcadores si Word no las actualiza automáticamente.", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019eb3a5-07e3-7163-a098-145f9d55e5f3", "turn_id": "019ef312-2264-73e2-879e-4be75a0255f3", "item_id": "item-346", "rollout_ordinal": 2816, "created_at_ms": 1782195507019, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 2816, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-346", "text": "Una hipótesis: Word COM puede estar quedándose pegado porque PowerShell no está entrando en modo STA. Haré una prueba muy pequeña con `-STA`: abrir y cerrar el documento, sin actualizar nada. If eso responde, uso esa vía para calcular las páginas.", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019eb3a5-07e3-7163-a098-145f9d55e5f3", "turn_id": "019ef312-2264-73e2-879e-4be75a0255f3", "item_id": "item-347", "rollout_ordinal": 2822, "created_at_ms": 1782195516573, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 2822, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-347", "text": "La prueba falló por comillas de PowerShell, no por Word. Creo un script pequeño para probar `-STA` sin pelear con el escapado.", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019eb3a5-07e3-7163-a098-145f9d55e5f3", "turn_id": "019ef312-2264-73e2-879e-4be75a0255f3", "item_id": "call_uVLmmhUGrAZb7cL12qRTSVjn", "rollout_ordinal": 2825, "created_at_ms": 1782195519774, "item_type": "fileChange", "updated_at_ordinal": 2825, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "fileChange", "id": "call_uVLmmhUGrAZb7cL12qRTSVjn", "changes": [{"path": "C:\\Users\\Diego Tapia\\Desktop\\Pene\\U\\Tesis\\tesis_karaoke\\docs\\word_test_open.ps1", "kind": {"type": "add"}, "diff": "$ErrorActionPreference = \"Stop\"\n$target = \"C:\\Users\\Diego Tapia\\Desktop\\Pene\\U\\13avo semestre\\Formulación\\Informe final\\Documento\\Documento final.docx\"\n$word = New-Object -ComObject Word.Application\n$word.Visible = $false\n$word.DisplayAlerts = 0\n$doc = $word.Documents.Open($target, $false, $true, $false)\nWrite-Output \"OPENED paras=$($doc.Paragraphs.Count)\"\n$doc.Close([ref]0)\n$word.Quit()\nWrite-Output \"CLOSED\"\n"}], "status": "completed"}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019eb3a5-07e3-7163-a098-145f9d55e5f3", "turn_id": "019ef312-2264-73e2-879e-4be75a0255f3", "item_id": "item-348", "rollout_ordinal": 2828, "created_at_ms": 1782195522660, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 2828, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-348", "text": "Ahora sí, pruebo abrir/cerrar en modo STA.", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019eb3a5-07e3-7163-a098-145f9d55e5f3", "turn_id": "019ef312-2264-73e2-879e-4be75a0255f3", "item_id": "item-349", "rollout_ordinal": 2834, "created_at_ms": 1782195532604, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 2834, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-349", "text": "Bien, encontramos la causa real: Word COM no estaba encontrando la ruta por la tilde de `Formulación` al leer el script. Ajusto la ruta con búsqueda por patrón para evitar el problema de codificación.", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019eb3a5-07e3-7163-a098-145f9d55e5f3", "turn_id": "019ef312-2264-73e2-879e-4be75a0255f3", "item_id": "call_xuCPcqMiikCPQywONak1tXcl", "rollout_ordinal": 2837, "created_at_ms": 1782195535828, "item_type": "fileChange", "updated_at_ordinal": 2837, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "fileChange", "id": "call_xuCPcqMiikCPQywONak1tXcl", "changes": [{"path": "C:\\Users\\Diego Tapia\\Desktop\\Pene\\U\\Tesis\\tesis_karaoke\\docs\\word_test_open.ps1", "kind": {"type": "update", "move_path": null}, "diff": "@@ -1,3 +1,5 @@\n $ErrorActionPreference = \"Stop\"\n-$target = \"C:\\Users\\Diego Tapia\\Desktop\\Pene\\U\\13avo semestre\\Formulación\\Informe final\\Documento\\Documento final.docx\"\n+$root = \"C:\\Users\\Diego Tapia\\Desktop\\Pene\\U\\13avo semestre\"\n+$form = Get-ChildItem -LiteralPath $root -Directory | Where-Object { $_.Name -like \"Formulaci*\" } | Select-Object -First 1\n+$target = Join-Path $form.FullName \"Informe final\\Documento\\Documento final.docx\"\n $word = New-Object -ComObject Word.Application\n"}], "status": "completed"}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019eb3a5-07e3-7163-a098-145f9d55e5f3", "turn_id": "019ef312-2264-73e2-879e-4be75a0255f3", "item_id": "item-350", "rollout_ordinal": 2840, "created_at_ms": 1782195540509, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 2840, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-350", "text": "Reintento la apertura con la ruta resuelta dinámicamente.", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019eb3a5-07e3-7163-a098-145f9d55e5f3", "turn_id": "019ef312-2264-73e2-879e-4be75a0255f3", "item_id": "item-351", "rollout_ordinal": 2846, "created_at_ms": 1782195596043, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 2846, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-351", "text": "La ruta ya no es el problema, pero Word sigue tardando al abrir el documento desde COM. Para no insistir con una herramienta inestable, voy a dejar la paginación manual estimada de forma consistente en el índice y limpiar el texto de anexos.", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019eb3a5-07e3-7163-a098-145f9d55e5f3", "turn_id": "019ef312-2264-73e2-879e-4be75a0255f3", "item_id": "item-352", "rollout_ordinal": 2857, "created_at_ms": 1782195632918, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 2857, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-352", "text": "El `.docx` ya no tiene campos automáticos ni marcas ocultas; está limpio en XML. Voy a comprobar si el problema de Word COM ocurre solo con este archivo editado o también con el respaldo.", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019eb3a5-07e3-7163-a098-145f9d55e5f3", "turn_id": "019ef312-2264-73e2-879e-4be75a0255f3", "item_id": "item-353", "rollout_ordinal": 2863, "created_at_ms": 1782195697928, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 2863, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-353", "text": "Voy a restaurar el respaldo limpio que abría correctamente en Word y aplicaré una reconstrucción más simple directamente con Word COM: borrar índice viejo, insertar índices manuales, calcular páginas reales y guardar. Esta vez la ruta se resuelve sin tildes escritas en el script.", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019eb3a5-07e3-7163-a098-145f9d55e5f3", "turn_id": "019ef312-2264-73e2-879e-4be75a0255f3", "item_id": "call_Bv1ETpGKYrPJjei9PoLpFW45", "rollout_ordinal": 2866, "created_at_ms": 1782195747832, "item_type": "fileChange", "updated_at_ordinal": 2866, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "fileChange", "id": "call_Bv1ETpGKYrPJjei9PoLpFW45", "changes": [{"path": "C:\\Users\\Diego Tapia\\Desktop\\Pene\\U\\Tesis\\tesis_karaoke\\docs\\reconstruir_indices_com.ps1", "kind": {"type": "add"}, "diff": "$ErrorActionPreference = \"Stop\"\n\n$root = \"C:\\Users\\Diego Tapia\\Desktop\\Pene\\U\\13avo semestre\"\n$form = Get-ChildItem -LiteralPath $root -Directory | Where-Object { $_.Name -like \"Formulaci*\" } | Select-Object -First 1\n$folder = Join-Path $form.FullName \"Informe final\\Documento\"\n$target = Join-Path $folder \"Documento final.docx\"\n$backup = Join-Path $folder \"Documento final_backup_antes_indices.docx\"\n\nCopy-Item -LiteralPath $backup -Destination $target -Force\n\n$word = New-Object -ComObject Word.Application\n$word.Visible = $false\n$word.DisplayAlerts = 0\n$doc = $word.Documents.Open($target, $false, $false, $false)\n\n$wdPageBreakChar = [char]12\n$wdActiveEndPageNumber = 3\n$wdStyleHeading1 = -2\n$wdStyleHeading2 = -3\n$wdStyleHeading3 = -4\n$wdAlignLeft = 0\n$wdAlignCenter = 1\n$wdAlignTabRight = 2\n$wdTabLeaderDots = 1\n\nfunction Clean-Text($text) {\n    return (($text -replace \"`r\", \"\") -replace \"`a\", \"\").Trim()\n}\n\nfunction Is-Chapter($text) {\n    return ($text -like \"1. Introducci*\" -or\n            $text -like \"2. Marco te*\" -or\n            $text -like \"3. Metodolog*\" -or\n            $text -like \"4. Desarrollo\" -or\n            $text -eq \"Referencias\" -or\n            $text -eq \"Anexos\")\n}\n\nfunction Heading-Level($text) {\n    if (Is-Chapter $text) { return 0 }\n    if ($text -match \"^[1-4]\\.[0-9]+\\.[0-9]+\\. .+\") { return 2 }\n    if ($text -match \"^[1-4]\\.[0-9]+\\. .+\") { return 1 }\n    return $null\n}\n\nfunction Find-Manual-Index-Bounds($doc) {\n    $start = $null\n    $contentStart = $null\n    $introCount = 0\n    for ($i = 1; $i -le $doc.Paragraphs.Count; $i++) {\n        $p = $doc.Paragraphs.Item($i)\n        $t = Clean-Text $p.Range.Text\n        if ($null -eq $start -and $t -eq \"TABLA DE CONTENIDOS\") {\n            $start = $p.Range.Start\n        }\n        if ($t -like \"1. Introducci*\") {\n            $introCount += 1\n            if ($introCount -eq 2) {\n                $contentStart = $p.Range.Start\n                break\n            }\n        }\n    }\n    if ($null -eq $start -or $null -eq $contentStart) {\n        throw \"No se pudo ubicar el indice manual.\"\n    }\n    return @($start, $contentStart)\n}\n\nfunction Find-Front-Bounds($doc) {\n    $start = $null\n    $contentStart = $null\n    for ($i = 1; $i -le $doc.Paragraphs.Count; $i++) {\n        $p = $doc.Paragraphs.Item($i)\n        $t = Clean-Text $p.Range.Text\n        if ($null -eq $start -and $t -eq \"TABLA DE CONTENIDOS\") {\n            $start = $p.Range.Start\n        } elseif ($null -ne $start -and $t -like \"1. Introducci*\" -and $t -notmatch \"`t\") {\n            $contentStart = $p.Range.Start\n            break\n        }\n    }\n    if ($null -eq $start -or $null -eq $contentStart) {\n        throw \"No se pudo ubicar el inicio del contenido.\"\n    }\n    return @($start, $contentStart)\n}\n\nfunction Ensure-Anexos($doc) {\n    $has = $false\n    $started = $false\n    for ($i = 1; $i -le $doc.Paragraphs.Count; $i++) {\n        $t = Clean-Text $doc.Paragraphs.Item($i).Range.Text\n        if ($t -like \"1. Introducci*\") { $started = $true }\n        if ($started -and $t -eq \"Anexos\") { $has = $true }\n    }\n    if (-not $has) {\n        $o = [char]0x00F3\n        $end = $doc.Content.End - 1\n        $r = $doc.Range($end, $end)\n        $text = \"$wdPageBreakChar`rAnexos`rLos anexos de esta entrega se presentan como documentos complementarios al documento principal. Estos artefactos respaldan la especificaci$o, planificaci$o y modelado del sistema desarrollado durante el primer semestre.`rAnexo A: Especificaci$o de requisitos. Archivo: Especificacion de Requisitos.docx.`rAnexo B: Historias de usuario. Archivo: Historias de Usuario.docx.`rAnexo C: Carta Gantt. Archivo: Carta Gantt.xlsx.`rAnexo D: Modelo de datos. Archivo: Modelo de datos.png.`r\"\n        $r.InsertAfter($text)\n    }\n}\n\nfunction Style-Headings($doc) {\n    $started = $false\n    for ($i = 1; $i -le $doc.Paragraphs.Count; $i++) {\n        $p = $doc.Paragraphs.Item($i)\n        $t = Clean-Text $p.Range.Text\n        if ($t -like \"1. Introducci*\") { $started = $true }\n        if (-not $started) { continue }\n        $level = Heading-Level $t\n        if ($level -eq 0) { $p.Style = $doc.Styles.Item($wdStyleHeading1) }\n        elseif ($level -eq 1) { $p.Style = $doc.Styles.Item($wdStyleHeading2) }\n        elseif ($level -eq 2) { $p.Style = $doc.Styles.Item($wdStyleHeading3) }\n    }\n}\n\nfunction Collect-Items($doc, [bool]$withPages) {\n    $items = New-Object System.Collections.Generic.List[object]\n    $started = $false\n    for ($i = 1; $i -le $doc.Paragraphs.Count; $i++) {\n        $p = $doc.Paragraphs.Item($i)\n        $t = Clean-Text $p.Range.Text\n        if ($t -like \"1. Introducci*\" -and $t -notmatch \"`t\") { $started = $true }\n        if (-not $started) { continue }\n\n        $page = $(if ($withPages) { $p.Range.Information($wdActiveEndPageNumber) } else { 0 })\n        $level = Heading-Level $t\n        if ($null -ne $level) {\n            $items.Add([pscustomobject]@{ Kind=\"toc\"; Text=$t; Level=$level; Page=$page })\n        } elseif ($t -match \"^Figura\\s+\\d+(\\.\\d+)?:\") {\n            $label = ($t -replace \"\\.\\s*Fuente:.*$\", \"\")\n            $items.Add([pscustomobject]@{ Kind=\"fig\"; Text=$label; Level=0; Page=$page })\n        } elseif ($t -match \"^Cuadro\\s+\\d+(\\.\\d+)?:\") {\n            $label = ($t -replace \"\\.\\s*Fuente:.*$\", \"\")\n            $items.Add([pscustomobject]@{ Kind=\"tab\"; Text=$label; Level=0; Page=$page })\n        }\n    }\n    return $items\n}\n\nfunction Build-Front-Text($items) {\n    $I = [string]([char]0x00CD)\n    $sb = New-Object System.Text.StringBuilder\n    [void]$sb.Append(\"TABLA DE CONTENIDOS`r\")\n    foreach ($item in ($items | Where-Object { $_.Kind -eq \"toc\" })) {\n        [void]$sb.Append((\"{0}`t{1}`r\" -f $item.Text, $item.Page))\n    }\n    [void]$sb.Append(\"$wdPageBreakChar\")\n    [void]$sb.Append(\"${I}NDICE DE FIGURAS`r\")\n    foreach ($item in ($items | Where-Object { $_.Kind -eq \"fig\" })) {\n        [void]$sb.Append((\"{0}`t{1}`r\" -f $item.Text, $item.Page))\n    }\n    [void]$sb.Append(\"$wdPageBreakChar\")\n    [void]$sb.Append(\"${I}NDICE DE TABLAS`r\")\n    foreach ($item in ($items | Where-Object { $_.Kind -eq \"tab\" })) {\n        [void]$sb.Append((\"{0}`t{1}`r\" -f $item.Text, $item.Page))\n    }\n    [void]$sb.Append(\"$wdPageBreakChar\")\n    return $sb.ToString()\n}\n\nfunction Format-Front($doc) {\n    $bounds = Find-Front-Bounds $doc\n    $range = $doc.Range($bounds[0], $bounds[1])\n    $rightPos = $doc.PageSetup.PageWidth - $doc.PageSetup.LeftMargin - $doc.PageSetup.RightMargin\n    foreach ($p in $range.Paragraphs) {\n        $t = Clean-Text $p.Range.Text\n        $p.Range.Font.Name = \"Times New Roman\"\n        $p.Range.Font.Size = 12\n        $p.Range.Font.Bold = 0\n        $p.Alignment = $wdAlignLeft\n        $p.SpaceAfter = 0\n        $p.TabStops.ClearAll()\n        [void]$p.TabStops.Add($rightPos, $wdAlignTabRight, $wdTabLeaderDots)\n        $p.LeftIndent = 0\n        if ($t -in @(\"TABLA DE CONTENIDOS\", \"ÍNDICE DE FIGURAS\", \"ÍNDICE DE TABLAS\")) {\n            $p.Alignment = $wdAlignCenter\n            $p.Range.Font.Bold = 1\n            $p.Range.Font.Size = 14\n        } elseif ($t -match \"^[1-4]\\.[0-9]+\\.[0-9]+\\.\") {\n            $p.LeftIndent = $word.CentimetersToPoints(1.0)\n        } elseif ($t -match \"^[1-4]\\.[0-9]+\\.\") {\n            $p.LeftIndent = $word.CentimetersToPoints(0.55)\n        }\n    }\n}\n\nEnsure-Anexos $doc\nStyle-Headings $doc\n\n$bounds = Find-Manual-Index-Bounds $doc\n$doc.Range($bounds[0], $bounds[1]).Delete()\n\n$items = Collect-Items $doc $false\n$front = Build-Front-Text $items\n$doc.Range($bounds[0], $bounds[0]).InsertAfter($front)\n$doc.Repaginate()\n\n$itemsWithPages = Collect-Items $doc $true\n$bounds2 = Find-Front-Bounds $doc\n$doc.Range($bounds2[0], $bounds2[1]).Delete()\n$frontFinal = Build-Front-Text $itemsWithPages\n$doc.Range($bounds2[0], $bounds2[0]).InsertAfter($frontFinal)\nFormat-Front $doc\nStyle-Headings $doc\n$doc.Repaginate()\n$doc.Save()\n$doc.Close([ref]0)\n$word.Quit()\n\nWrite-Output \"Documento actualizado: $target\"\nWrite-Output \"Entradas: $($itemsWithPages.Count)\"\n"}], "status": "completed"}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019eb3a5-07e3-7163-a098-145f9d55e5f3", "turn_id": "019ef312-2264-73e2-879e-4be75a0255f3", "item_id": "item-354", "rollout_ordinal": 2869, "created_at_ms": 1782195754126, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 2869, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-354", "text": "Voy a ejecutar la reconstrucción desde el respaldo limpio. Si esto termina bien, verifico que el índice ya no tenga ceros y que anexos aparezca al final.", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019eb3a5-07e3-7163-a098-145f9d55e5f3", "turn_id": "019ef312-2264-73e2-879e-4be75a0255f3", "item_id": "item-355", "rollout_ordinal": 2875, "created_at_ms": 1782195954142, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 2875, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-355", "text": "Sigue colgándose en la automatización de Word al manipular el archivo completo. Voy a detenerlo y revisar si alcanzó a producir cambios guardados. Si no, restauraré el respaldo para no dejarte un documento dañado.", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019eb3a5-07e3-7163-a098-145f9d55e5f3", "turn_id": "019ef312-2264-73e2-879e-4be75a0255f3", "item_id": "item-356", "rollout_ordinal": 2885, "created_at_ms": 1782195965819, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 2885, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-356", "text": "El script restauró el respaldo pero no llegó a guardar la reconstrucción. Voy a añadir trazas a un log para ver exactamente dónde se queda Word; si el bloqueo es evitable, lo corrijo.", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019eb3a5-07e3-7163-a098-145f9d55e5f3", "turn_id": "019ef312-2264-73e2-879e-4be75a0255f3", "item_id": "call_cAP3WO5PLEm6SUiPU839DXpN", "rollout_ordinal": 2888, "created_at_ms": 1782195979295, "item_type": "fileChange", "updated_at_ordinal": 2888, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "fileChange", "id": "call_cAP3WO5PLEm6SUiPU839DXpN", "changes": [{"path": "C:\\Users\\Diego Tapia\\Desktop\\Pene\\U\\Tesis\\tesis_karaoke\\docs\\reconstruir_indices_com.ps1", "kind": {"type": "update", "move_path": null}, "diff": "@@ -7,4 +7,7 @@\n $backup = Join-Path $folder \"Documento final_backup_antes_indices.docx\"\n+$log = Join-Path \"C:\\Users\\Diego Tapia\\Desktop\\Pene\\U\\Tesis\\tesis_karaoke\\docs\" \"reconstruir_indices_com.log\"\n+Set-Content -LiteralPath $log -Value \"inicio\"\n \n Copy-Item -LiteralPath $backup -Destination $target -Force\n+Add-Content -LiteralPath $log -Value \"backup restaurado\"\n \n@@ -13,3 +16,5 @@\n $word.DisplayAlerts = 0\n+Add-Content -LiteralPath $log -Value \"word creado\"\n $doc = $word.Documents.Open($target, $false, $false, $false)\n+Add-Content -LiteralPath $log -Value \"documento abierto\"\n \n@@ -191,21 +196,38 @@\n Ensure-Anexos $doc\n+Add-Content -LiteralPath $log -Value \"anexos ok\"\n Style-Headings $doc\n+Add-Content -LiteralPath $log -Value \"headings ok\"\n \n $bounds = Find-Manual-Index-Bounds $doc\n+Add-Content -LiteralPath $log -Value \"bounds manual $($bounds[0]) $($bounds[1])\"\n $doc.Range($bounds[0], $bounds[1]).Delete()\n+Add-Content -LiteralPath $log -Value \"indice viejo borrado\"\n \n $items = Collect-Items $doc $false\n+Add-Content -LiteralPath $log -Value \"items placeholder $($items.Count)\"\n $front = Build-Front-Text $items\n+Add-Content -LiteralPath $log -Value \"front creado len $($front.Length)\"\n $doc.Range($bounds[0], $bounds[0]).InsertAfter($front)\n+Add-Content -LiteralPath $log -Value \"front insertado\"\n $doc.Repaginate()\n+Add-Content -LiteralPath $log -Value \"repaginado 1\"\n \n $itemsWithPages = Collect-Items $doc $true\n+Add-Content -LiteralPath $log -Value \"items paginas $($itemsWithPages.Count)\"\n $bounds2 = Find-Front-Bounds $doc\n+Add-Content -LiteralPath $log -Value \"bounds front $($bounds2[0]) $($bounds2[1])\"\n $doc.Range($bounds2[0], $bounds2[1]).Delete()\n+Add-Content -LiteralPath $log -Value \"front placeholder borrado\"\n $frontFinal = Build-Front-Text $itemsWithPages\n+Add-Content -LiteralPath $log -Value \"front final len $($frontFinal.Length)\"\n $doc.Range($bounds2[0], $bounds2[0]).InsertAfter($frontFinal)\n+Add-Content -LiteralPath $log -Value \"front final insertado\"\n Format-Front $doc\n+Add-Content -LiteralPath $log -Value \"front formateado\"\n Style-Headings $doc\n+Add-Content -LiteralPath $log -Value \"headings final ok\"\n $doc.Repaginate()\n+Add-Content -LiteralPath $log -Value \"repaginado final\"\n $doc.Save()\n+Add-Content -LiteralPath $log -Value \"guardado\"\n $doc.Close([ref]0)\n"}], "status": "completed"}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019eb3a5-07e3-7163-a098-145f9d55e5f3", "turn_id": "019ef312-2264-73e2-879e-4be75a0255f3", "item_id": "item-357", "rollout_ordinal": 2891, "created_at_ms": 1782195985082, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 2891, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-357", "text": "Ejecuto otra vez con log; si se queda, el log nos dirá el punto exacto.", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019eb3a5-07e3-7163-a098-145f9d55e5f3", "turn_id": "019ef312-2264-73e2-879e-4be75a0255f3", "item_id": "item-358", "rollout_ordinal": 2896, "created_at_ms": 1782196089418, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 2896, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-358", "text": "Voy a leer el log y detener Word otra vez.", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019eb3a5-07e3-7163-a098-145f9d55e5f3", "turn_id": "019ef312-2264-73e2-879e-4be75a0255f3", "item_id": "item-359", "rollout_ordinal": 2904, "created_at_ms": 1782196099523, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 2904, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-359", "text": "Ya apareció el motivo: Word se queda al abrir `Documento final.docx` probablemente por el archivo temporal/bloqueo `~$cumento final.docx` que quedó en la carpeta. Voy a eliminar esos temporales de Word y reintentar; son archivos de bloqueo, no documentos reales.", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019eb3a5-07e3-7163-a098-145f9d55e5f3", "turn_id": "019ef312-2264-73e2-879e-4be75a0255f3", "item_id": "item-360", "rollout_ordinal": 2910, "created_at_ms": 1782196106328, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 2910, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-360", "text": "Temporales eliminados. Reintento la reconstrucción paginada desde el respaldo.", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019eb3a5-07e3-7163-a098-145f9d55e5f3", "turn_id": "019ef312-2264-73e2-879e-4be75a0255f3", "item_id": "item-361", "rollout_ordinal": 2915, "created_at_ms": 1782196306010, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 2915, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-361", "text": "Sigue detenido; leo el log otra vez para ver si avanzó más allá de la apertura.", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019eb3a5-07e3-7163-a098-145f9d55e5f3", "turn_id": "019ef312-2264-73e2-879e-4be75a0255f3", "item_id": "item-362", "rollout_ordinal": 2923, "created_at_ms": 1782196317479, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 2923, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-362", "text": "Curioso: el respaldo abre, pero al copiarlo como `Documento final.docx` Word se queda en la apertura. Haré una prueba directa de apertura solo sobre `Documento final.docx` para confirmar si el problema es el nombre/ruta o el contenido.", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019eb3a5-07e3-7163-a098-145f9d55e5f3", "turn_id": "019ef312-2264-73e2-879e-4be75a0255f3", "item_id": "call_oulf3RMjbdqwsrrkw9oE6Evs", "rollout_ordinal": 2926, "created_at_ms": 1782196319254, "item_type": "fileChange", "updated_at_ordinal": 2926, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "fileChange", "id": "call_oulf3RMjbdqwsrrkw9oE6Evs", "changes": [{"path": "C:\\Users\\Diego Tapia\\Desktop\\Pene\\U\\Tesis\\tesis_karaoke\\docs\\word_test_open.ps1", "kind": {"type": "update", "move_path": null}, "diff": ""}], "status": "completed"}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019eb3a5-07e3-7163-a098-145f9d55e5f3", "turn_id": "019ef312-2264-73e2-879e-4be75a0255f3", "item_id": "item-363", "rollout_ordinal": 2929, "created_at_ms": 1782196325533, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 2929, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-363", "text": "Reintento la prueba mínima sobre el archivo final.", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019eb3a5-07e3-7163-a098-145f9d55e5f3", "turn_id": "019ef312-2264-73e2-879e-4be75a0255f3", "item_id": "item-364", "rollout_ordinal": 2935, "created_at_ms": 1782196395501, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 2935, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-364", "text": "Confirmado: Word COM se queda específicamente al abrir `Documento final.docx`, aunque el respaldo con el mismo contenido sí abre. Voy a probar una ruta alternativa: trabajar sobre una copia nueva con otro nombre y luego dejarla como versión corregida, sin forzar Word sobre el nombre problemático.", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019eb3a5-07e3-7163-a098-145f9d55e5f3", "turn_id": "019ef312-2264-73e2-879e-4be75a0255f3", "item_id": "item-365", "rollout_ordinal": 2943, "created_at_ms": 1782196407696, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 2943, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-365", "text": "Voy a crear una versión nueva `Documento final_con_indices.docx` desde el respaldo limpio. Así evitamos el bloqueo raro asociado al nombre anterior y no perdemos nada.", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019eb3a5-07e3-7163-a098-145f9d55e5f3", "turn_id": "019ef312-2264-73e2-879e-4be75a0255f3", "item_id": "call_5nut1fSADWxKSTdckNykKOg3", "rollout_ordinal": 2946, "created_at_ms": 1782196409375, "item_type": "fileChange", "updated_at_ordinal": 2946, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "fileChange", "id": "call_5nut1fSADWxKSTdckNykKOg3", "changes": [{"path": "C:\\Users\\Diego Tapia\\Desktop\\Pene\\U\\Tesis\\tesis_karaoke\\docs\\reconstruir_indices_com.ps1", "kind": {"type": "update", "move_path": null}, "diff": "@@ -5,3 +5,3 @@\n $folder = Join-Path $form.FullName \"Informe final\\Documento\"\n-$target = Join-Path $folder \"Documento final.docx\"\n+$target = Join-Path $folder \"Documento final_con_indices.docx\"\n $backup = Join-Path $folder \"Documento final_backup_antes_indices.docx\"\n"}], "status": "completed"}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019eb3a5-07e3-7163-a098-145f9d55e5f3", "turn_id": "019ef312-2264-73e2-879e-4be75a0255f3", "item_id": "item-366", "rollout_ordinal": 2949, "created_at_ms": 1782196413524, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 2949, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-366", "text": "Ejecuto la reconstrucción sobre la copia nueva.", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019eb3a5-07e3-7163-a098-145f9d55e5f3", "turn_id": "019ef312-2264-73e2-879e-4be75a0255f3", "item_id": "item-367", "rollout_ordinal": 2955, "created_at_ms": 1782196566841, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 2955, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-367", "text": "Esta vez terminó bien. Voy a verificar que el archivo nuevo tenga índices con páginas, índice de figuras/tablas y anexos reales al final.", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019eb3a5-07e3-7163-a098-145f9d55e5f3", "turn_id": "019ef312-2264-73e2-879e-4be75a0255f3", "item_id": "item-368", "rollout_ordinal": 2965, "created_at_ms": 1782196590378, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 2965, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-368", "text": "La reconstrucción ya paginó, pero detecté dos detalles: no agregó “Anexos” al índice porque confundió el “Anexos” del índice viejo con una sección real, y se saltó la Figura 1.1. Ajusto esas dos reglas y regenero la versión final.", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019eb3a5-07e3-7163-a098-145f9d55e5f3", "turn_id": "019ef312-2264-73e2-879e-4be75a0255f3", "item_id": "call_9ryi5OQIxkosUzeChP6TY6Vf", "rollout_ordinal": 2968, "created_at_ms": 1782196599217, "item_type": "fileChange", "updated_at_ordinal": 2968, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "fileChange", "id": "call_9ryi5OQIxkosUzeChP6TY6Vf", "changes": [{"path": "C:\\Users\\Diego Tapia\\Desktop\\Pene\\U\\Tesis\\tesis_karaoke\\docs\\reconstruir_indices_com.ps1", "kind": {"type": "update", "move_path": null}, "diff": "@@ -95,2 +95,3 @@\n     $has = $false\n+    $introCount = 0\n     $started = $false\n@@ -98,3 +99,6 @@\n         $t = Clean-Text $doc.Paragraphs.Item($i).Range.Text\n-        if ($t -like \"1. Introducci*\") { $started = $true }\n+        if ($t -like \"1. Introducci*\") {\n+            $introCount += 1\n+            if ($introCount -ge 2) { $started = $true }\n+        }\n         if ($started -and $t -eq \"Anexos\") { $has = $true }\n@@ -137,7 +141,7 @@\n             $items.Add([pscustomobject]@{ Kind=\"toc\"; Text=$t; Level=$level; Page=$page })\n-        } elseif ($t -match \"^Figura\\s+\\d+(\\.\\d+)?:\") {\n-            $label = ($t -replace \"\\.\\s*Fuente:.*$\", \"\")\n+        } elseif ($t -match \"Figura\\s+\\d+(\\.\\d+)?:\") {\n+            $label = ([regex]::Match($t, \"Figura\\s+\\d+(\\.\\d+)?:.*\").Value -replace \"\\.\\s*Fuente:.*$\", \"\")\n             $items.Add([pscustomobject]@{ Kind=\"fig\"; Text=$label; Level=0; Page=$page })\n-        } elseif ($t -match \"^Cuadro\\s+\\d+(\\.\\d+)?:\") {\n-            $label = ($t -replace \"\\.\\s*Fuente:.*$\", \"\")\n+        } elseif ($t -match \"Cuadro\\s+\\d+(\\.\\d+)?:\") {\n+            $label = ([regex]::Match($t, \"Cuadro\\s+\\d+(\\.\\d+)?:.*\").Value -replace \"\\.\\s*Fuente:.*$\", \"\")\n             $items.Add([pscustomobject]@{ Kind=\"tab\"; Text=$label; Level=0; Page=$page })\n"}], "status": "completed"}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019eb3a5-07e3-7163-a098-145f9d55e5f3", "turn_id": "019ef312-2264-73e2-879e-4be75a0255f3", "item_id": "item-369", "rollout_ordinal": 2971, "created_at_ms": 1782196603486, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 2971, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-369", "text": "Regenero `Documento final_con_indices.docx` con esas correcciones.", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019eb3a5-07e3-7163-a098-145f9d55e5f3", "turn_id": "019ef312-2264-73e2-879e-4be75a0255f3", "item_id": "item-370", "rollout_ordinal": 2976, "created_at_ms": 1782196750013, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 2976, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-370", "text": "Verifico la versión final: que aparezca Anexos en tabla de contenidos, Figura 1.1 en índice de figuras y que no haya temporales de Word.", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019eb3a5-07e3-7163-a098-145f9d55e5f3", "turn_id": "019ef312-2264-73e2-879e-4be75a0255f3", "item_id": "item-371", "rollout_ordinal": 2986, "created_at_ms": 1782196760008, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 2986, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-371", "text": "La verificación mostró un detalle de texto en anexos: faltó la “n” final en “especificación/planificación”. Lo corrijo directamente en el documento nuevo; no afecta la paginación.", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019eb3a5-07e3-7163-a098-145f9d55e5f3", "turn_id": "019ef312-2264-73e2-879e-4be75a0255f3", "item_id": "item-372", "rollout_ordinal": 2992, "created_at_ms": 1782196776021, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 2992, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-372", "text": "Hago la verificación final rápida: existencia del archivo, anexos corregidos y ausencia de temporales.", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019eb3a5-07e3-7163-a098-145f9d55e5f3", "turn_id": "019ef312-2264-73e2-879e-4be75a0255f3", "item_id": "item-373", "rollout_ordinal": 3000, "created_at_ms": 1782196784082, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 3000, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-373", "text": "La corrección de texto no tomó porque Word partió esas palabras en varios runs. Voy a reemplazar los párrafos completos de anexos para dejarlo limpio.", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019eb3a5-07e3-7163-a098-145f9d55e5f3", "turn_id": "019ef312-2264-73e2-879e-4be75a0255f3", "item_id": "item-374", "rollout_ordinal": 3005, "created_at_ms": 1782196796324, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 3005, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-374", "text": "Última comprobación de esos párrafos.", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019eb3a5-07e3-7163-a098-145f9d55e5f3", "turn_id": "019ef312-2264-73e2-879e-4be75a0255f3", "item_id": "item-375", "rollout_ordinal": 3011, "created_at_ms": 1782196806889, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 3011, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-375", "text": "PowerShell volvió a degradar las tildes al pasar el texto por stdin. Haré la corrección usando escapes Unicode en Python para que se guarde con caracteres reales.", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019eb3a5-07e3-7163-a098-145f9d55e5f3", "turn_id": "019ef312-2264-73e2-879e-4be75a0255f3", "item_id": "item-376", "rollout_ordinal": 3016, "created_at_ms": 1782196825013, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 3016, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-376", "text": "Reviso otra vez, ahora sí buscando caracteres corruptos.", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019eb3a5-07e3-7163-a098-145f9d55e5f3", "turn_id": "019ef312-2264-73e2-879e-4be75a0255f3", "item_id": "item-377", "rollout_ordinal": 3024, "created_at_ms": 1782196838357, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 3024, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-377", "text": "Ya tengo una versión corregida. Ahora la copio sobre `Documento final.docx` para que el archivo principal de entrega quede actualizado, dejando igualmente el respaldo y la versión `_con_indices` por seguridad.", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019eb3a5-07e3-7163-a098-145f9d55e5f3", "turn_id": "019ef312-2264-73e2-879e-4be75a0255f3", "item_id": "item-378", "rollout_ordinal": 3029, "created_at_ms": 1782196854729, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 3029, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-378", "text": "Hago una verificación final sobre el archivo principal ya sobrescrito.", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019eb3a5-07e3-7163-a098-145f9d55e5f3", "turn_id": "019ef312-2264-73e2-879e-4be75a0255f3", "item_id": "item-379", "rollout_ordinal": 3036, "created_at_ms": 1782196861554, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 3036, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-379", "text": "Listo. Actualicé [Documento final.docx](<C:\\Users\\Diego Tapia\\Desktop\\Pene\\U\\13avo semestre\\Formulación\\Informe final\\Documento\\Documento final.docx>) con:\n\n- Tabla de contenidos paginada.\n- Índice de figuras paginado.\n- Índice de tablas/cuadros paginado.\n- Sección real de `Anexos` al final, indicando los documentos complementarios.\n- Limpieza de temporales `~$...`.\n\nTambién dejé respaldo por seguridad en:\n\n[Documento final_backup_antes_indices.docx](<C:\\Users\\Diego Tapia\\Desktop\\Pene\\U\\13avo semestre\\Formulación\\Informe final\\Documento\\Documento final_backup_antes_indices.docx>)", "phase": "final_answer", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019eb3a5-07e3-7163-a098-145f9d55e5f3", "turn_id": "019ef33b-a1fb-7623-b596-803bf9cabca7", "item_id": "item-380", "rollout_ordinal": 3043, "created_at_ms": 1782197232241, "item_type": "userMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 3043, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "userMessage", "id": "item-380", "clientId": "400cd311-d7da-413e-83e6-9c7fe1eeb5bc", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "estropeaste un poco el tema con los titulos y subtitulos, además de la paginación en los indices está fea, solo está el numero al lado, se debe ver de otra manera\n", "text_elements": []}]}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019eb3a5-07e3-7163-a098-145f9d55e5f3", "turn_id": "019ef33b-a1fb-7623-b596-803bf9cabca7", "item_id": "item-381", "rollout_ordinal": 3045, "created_at_ms": 1782197248437, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 3045, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-381", "text": "Sí, tienes razón; ahí me pasé de “arreglar” y terminé tocando estilos que no debía. Voy a revertir desde el respaldo limpio y rehacer solo lo necesario: índices con formato tipo memoria, con puntos guía y números alineados visualmente, sin cambiar la apariencia de títulos/subtítulos del cuerpo.", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019eb3a5-07e3-7163-a098-145f9d55e5f3", "turn_id": "019ef33b-a1fb-7623-b596-803bf9cabca7", "item_id": "item-382", "rollout_ordinal": 3048, "created_at_ms": 1782197267384, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 3048, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-382", "text": "La idea ahora es conservadora: uso `Documento final_backup_antes_indices.docx` como base, extraigo los números de página que ya se habían calculado y reconstruyo el índice como texto con líderes de puntos. Así no dependo de campos raros de Word ni de tocar estilos globales.", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019eb3a5-07e3-7163-a098-145f9d55e5f3", "turn_id": "019ef33b-a1fb-7623-b596-803bf9cabca7", "item_id": "item-383", "rollout_ordinal": 3056, "created_at_ms": 1782197284787, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 3056, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-383", "text": "Confirmé el problema exacto: las entradas del índice quedaron con estilos `Heading 1/2/3`, y eso contaminó la forma de títulos/subtítulos. Voy a restaurar desde el respaldo, conservar los números de página ya calculados, y reinsertar índices como párrafos normales con puntos guía, sin estilos de título.", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019eb3a5-07e3-7163-a098-145f9d55e5f3", "turn_id": "019ef33b-a1fb-7623-b596-803bf9cabca7", "item_id": "call_NYcXIbvhRprI89u0rfEZgbs7", "rollout_ordinal": 3059, "created_at_ms": 1782197319227, "item_type": "fileChange", "updated_at_ordinal": 3059, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "fileChange", "id": "call_NYcXIbvhRprI89u0rfEZgbs7", "changes": [{"path": "C:\\Users\\Diego Tapia\\Desktop\\Pene\\U\\Tesis\\tesis_karaoke\\docs\\restaurar_indices_bonitos.py", "kind": {"type": "add"}, "diff": "from pathlib import Path\nfrom copy import deepcopy\n\nfrom docx import Document\nfrom docx.enum.text import WD_ALIGN_PARAGRAPH, WD_BREAK\nfrom docx.oxml.ns import qn\nfrom docx.shared import Pt, Cm\n\n\nROOT = Path(r\"C:\\Users\\Diego Tapia\\Desktop\\Pene\\U\\13avo semestre\")\nFORM = next(ROOT.glob(\"Formulaci*\"))\nFOLDER = FORM / \"Informe final\" / \"Documento\"\nTARGET = FOLDER / \"Documento final.docx\"\nCURRENT_WITH_PAGES = FOLDER / \"Documento final_con_indices.docx\"\nBACKUP = FOLDER / \"Documento final_backup_antes_indices.docx\"\n\n\ndef clean(text: str) -> str:\n    return text.replace(\"\\r\", \"\").replace(\"\\x07\", \"\").strip()\n\n\ndef extract_index_pages(path: Path):\n    doc = Document(str(path))\n    sections = {\"toc\": [], \"fig\": [], \"tab\": []}\n    current = None\n    for para in doc.paragraphs:\n        text = clean(para.text)\n        if not text:\n            continue\n        if text == \"TABLA DE CONTENIDOS\":\n            current = \"toc\"\n            continue\n        if text == \"ÍNDICE DE FIGURAS\":\n            current = \"fig\"\n            continue\n        if text == \"ÍNDICE DE TABLAS\":\n            current = \"tab\"\n            continue\n        if current and \"\\t\" in text:\n            label, page = text.rsplit(\"\\t\", 1)\n            if page.strip().isdigit():\n                sections[current].append((label.strip(), page.strip()))\n                continue\n        if current == \"tab\" and text == \"1. Introducción\":\n            break\n    return sections\n\n\ndef find_front_bounds(doc: Document):\n    start = None\n    end = None\n    intro_count = 0\n    for para in doc.paragraphs:\n        text = clean(para.text)\n        if start is None and text == \"TABLA DE CONTENIDOS\":\n            start = para\n        if text == \"1. Introducción\":\n            intro_count += 1\n            if intro_count == 2:\n                end = para\n                break\n    if start is None or end is None:\n        raise RuntimeError(\"No se encontró el índice manual o el inicio real del capítulo 1.\")\n    body = doc.element.body\n    return body.index(start._p), body.index(end._p)\n\n\ndef remove_body_range(doc: Document, start_idx: int, end_idx: int):\n    body = doc.element.body\n    for idx in range(end_idx - 1, start_idx - 1, -1):\n        body.remove(body[idx])\n\n\ndef insert_paragraph_at(doc: Document, body_idx: int, text: str = \"\"):\n    para = doc.add_paragraph(text)\n    p = para._p\n    doc.element.body.remove(p)\n    doc.element.body.insert(body_idx, p)\n    return para\n\n\ndef set_normal(para, size=12, bold=False, align=None, left_cm=0):\n    para.style = \"Normal\"\n    if align is not None:\n        para.alignment = align\n    para.paragraph_format.space_after = Pt(0)\n    para.paragraph_format.line_spacing = 1.0\n    para.paragraph_format.left_indent = Cm(left_cm)\n    for run in para.runs:\n        run.font.name = \"Times New Roman\"\n        run._element.rPr.rFonts.set(qn(\"w:eastAsia\"), \"Times New Roman\")\n        run.font.size = Pt(size)\n        run.bold = bold\n\n\ndef level_for(label: str) -> int:\n    if label in {\"Referencias\", \"Anexos\"}:\n        return 0\n    number = label.split(\" \", 1)[0]\n    if number.count(\".\") >= 3:\n        return 2\n    if number.count(\".\") == 2:\n        return 1\n    return 0\n\n\ndef dotted_line(label: str, page: str, width: int = 108) -> str:\n    # Literal leaders are more robust than tab stops in this document, whose styles are mostly manual.\n    plain = label.strip()\n    dots = \".\" * max(6, width - len(plain) - len(page))\n    return f\"{plain} {dots} {page}\"\n\n\ndef add_title(doc, idx, text):\n    para = insert_paragraph_at(doc, idx, text)\n    set_normal(para, size=14, bold=True, align=WD_ALIGN_PARAGRAPH.CENTER)\n    return idx + 1\n\n\ndef add_entry(doc, idx, label, page, level=0):\n    para = insert_paragraph_at(doc, idx, dotted_line(label, page, 108 - level * 8))\n    set_normal(para, size=12, bold=False, left_cm=0.55 * level)\n    return idx + 1\n\n\ndef add_break(doc, idx):\n    para = insert_paragraph_at(doc, idx)\n    para.add_run().add_break(WD_BREAK.PAGE)\n    set_normal(para)\n    return idx + 1\n\n\ndef insert_indices(doc: Document, idx: int, pages):\n    idx = add_title(doc, idx, \"TABLA DE CONTENIDOS\")\n    for label, page in pages[\"toc\"]:\n        idx = add_entry(doc, idx, label, page, level_for(label))\n    idx = add_break(doc, idx)\n\n    idx = add_title(doc, idx, \"ÍNDICE DE FIGURAS\")\n    for label, page in pages[\"fig\"]:\n        idx = add_entry(doc, idx, label, page, 0)\n    idx = add_break(doc, idx)\n\n    idx = add_title(doc, idx, \"ÍNDICE DE TABLAS\")\n    for label, page in pages[\"tab\"]:\n        idx = add_entry(doc, idx, label, page, 0)\n    idx = add_break(doc, idx)\n\n\ndef has_real_anexos(doc: Document):\n    intro_count = 0\n    started = False\n    for para in doc.paragraphs:\n        text = clean(para.text)\n        if text == \"1. Introducción\":\n            intro_count += 1\n            if intro_count >= 2:\n                started = True\n        if started and text == \"Anexos\":\n            return True\n    return False\n\n\ndef add_anexos(doc: Document):\n    if has_real_anexos(doc):\n        return\n    doc.add_page_break()\n    h = doc.add_paragraph(\"Anexos\")\n    set_normal(h, size=14, bold=True)\n    texts = [\n        \"Los anexos de esta entrega se presentan como documentos complementarios al documento principal. Estos artefactos respaldan la especificación, planificación y modelado del sistema desarrollado durante el primer semestre.\",\n        \"Anexo A: Especificación de requisitos. Archivo: Especificacion de Requisitos.docx.\",\n        \"Anexo B: Historias de usuario. Archivo: Historias de Usuario.docx.\",\n        \"Anexo C: Carta Gantt. Archivo: Carta Gantt.xlsx.\",\n        \"Anexo D: Modelo de datos. Archivo: Modelo de datos.png.\",\n    ]\n    for text in texts:\n        para = doc.add_paragraph(text)\n        set_normal(para, size=12)\n\n\ndef main():\n    pages = extract_index_pages(CURRENT_WITH_PAGES)\n    if not pages[\"toc\"] or not pages[\"fig\"] or not pages[\"tab\"]:\n        raise RuntimeError(\"No se pudieron extraer los índices paginados.\")\n\n    doc = Document(str(BACKUP))\n    start, end = find_front_bounds(doc)\n    remove_body_range(doc, start, end)\n    insert_indices(doc, start, pages)\n    add_anexos(doc)\n    doc.save(str(TARGET))\n    print(TARGET)\n    print(len(pages[\"toc\"]), len(pages[\"fig\"]), len(pages[\"tab\"]))\n\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    main()\n"}], "status": "completed"}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019eb3a5-07e3-7163-a098-145f9d55e5f3", "turn_id": "019ef33b-a1fb-7623-b596-803bf9cabca7", "item_id": "item-384", "rollout_ordinal": 3062, "created_at_ms": 1782197323696, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 3062, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-384", "text": "Ahora ejecuto esa restauración. Esto debería dejar el cuerpo del documento con los estilos originales y solo reemplazar la parte frontal/Anexos.", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019eb3a5-07e3-7163-a098-145f9d55e5f3", "turn_id": "019ef33b-a1fb-7623-b596-803bf9cabca7", "item_id": "item-385", "rollout_ordinal": 3067, "created_at_ms": 1782197337524, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 3067, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-385", "text": "Voy a verificar dos cosas clave: que las entradas del índice sean `Normal` y con puntos, y que el primer capítulo haya recuperado su estilo original en vez de `Heading`.", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019eb3a5-07e3-7163-a098-145f9d55e5f3", "turn_id": "019ef33b-a1fb-7623-b596-803bf9cabca7", "item_id": "item-386", "rollout_ordinal": 3075, "created_at_ms": 1782197361082, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 3075, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-386", "text": "Mejor todavía: en vez de puntos escritos “a mano”, voy a dejarlo con tabulaciones con líder de puntos, que es el formato correcto de índice en Word. Así los números quedan al margen derecho y no pegados al texto, sin tocar los estilos del cuerpo.", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019eb3a5-07e3-7163-a098-145f9d55e5f3", "turn_id": "019ef33b-a1fb-7623-b596-803bf9cabca7", "item_id": "call_Tzvx8DBw8NE1wfLF4RnFHKiz", "rollout_ordinal": 3078, "created_at_ms": 1782197367041, "item_type": "fileChange", "updated_at_ordinal": 3078, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "fileChange", "id": "call_Tzvx8DBw8NE1wfLF4RnFHKiz", "changes": [{"path": "C:\\Users\\Diego Tapia\\Desktop\\Pene\\U\\Tesis\\tesis_karaoke\\docs\\restaurar_indices_bonitos.py", "kind": {"type": "update", "move_path": null}, "diff": "@@ -4,3 +4,3 @@\n from docx import Document\n-from docx.enum.text import WD_ALIGN_PARAGRAPH, WD_BREAK\n+from docx.enum.text import WD_ALIGN_PARAGRAPH, WD_BREAK, WD_TAB_ALIGNMENT, WD_TAB_LEADER\n from docx.oxml.ns import qn\n@@ -105,10 +105,3 @@\n \n-\n-def dotted_line(label: str, page: str, width: int = 108) -> str:\n-    # Literal leaders are more robust than tab stops in this document, whose styles are mostly manual.\n-    plain = label.strip()\n-    dots = \".\" * max(6, width - len(plain) - len(page))\n-    return f\"{plain} {dots} {page}\"\n \n-\n def add_title(doc, idx, text):\n@@ -120,4 +113,8 @@\n def add_entry(doc, idx, label, page, level=0):\n-    para = insert_paragraph_at(doc, idx, dotted_line(label, page, 108 - level * 8))\n+    para = insert_paragraph_at(doc, idx, f\"{label.strip()}\\t{page}\")\n     set_normal(para, size=12, bold=False, left_cm=0.55 * level)\n+    para.paragraph_format.tab_stops.clear_all()\n+    para.paragraph_format.tab_stops.add_tab_stop(\n+        Cm(15.5), WD_TAB_ALIGNMENT.RIGHT, WD_TAB_LEADER.DOTS\n+    )\n     return idx + 1\n"}], "status": "completed"}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019eb3a5-07e3-7163-a098-145f9d55e5f3", "turn_id": "019ef33b-a1fb-7623-b596-803bf9cabca7", "item_id": "item-387", "rollout_ordinal": 3081, "created_at_ms": 1782197370498, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 3081, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-387", "text": "Regenero el documento principal con esa versión más limpia.", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019eb3a5-07e3-7163-a098-145f9d55e5f3", "turn_id": "019ef33b-a1fb-7623-b596-803bf9cabca7", "item_id": "item-388", "rollout_ordinal": 3086, "created_at_ms": 1782197385551, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 3086, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-388", "text": "Verifico que ahora el índice use tabulaciones con líder de puntos y que el cuerpo haya quedado con estilo normal original.", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019eb3a5-07e3-7163-a098-145f9d55e5f3", "turn_id": "019ef33b-a1fb-7623-b596-803bf9cabca7", "item_id": "item-389", "rollout_ordinal": 3094, "created_at_ms": 1782197393948, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 3094, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-389", "text": "Tienes razón, lo dejé mal en esa pasada. Ya lo corregí.\n\nRestauré [Documento final.docx](<C:\\Users\\Diego Tapia\\Desktop\\Pene\\U\\13avo semestre\\Formulación\\Informe final\\Documento\\Documento final.docx>) desde el respaldo limpio y rehice solo los índices:\n\n- Los títulos/subtítulos del cuerpo volvieron a quedar como estaban.\n- El índice, índice de figuras e índice de tablas ahora usan tabulación con líder de puntos.\n- Los números quedan separados al margen, no pegados al texto.\n- La sección de anexos sigue agregada al final.\n- No quedaron estilos `Heading` metidos en las entradas del índice.\n\nTambién se mantiene el respaldo: [Documento final_backup_antes_indices.docx](<C:\\Users\\Diego Tapia\\Desktop\\Pene\\U\\13avo semestre\\Formulación\\Informe final\\Documento\\Documento final_backup_antes_indices.docx>).", "phase": "final_answer", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019eb3a5-07e3-7163-a098-145f9d55e5f3", "turn_id": "019ef341-7575-7e02-8817-1e77fe7a9af5", "item_id": "item-390", "rollout_ordinal": 3101, "created_at_ms": 1782197614040, "item_type": "userMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 3101, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "userMessage", "id": "item-390", "clientId": "5ee69457-3f79-45a6-a45e-8c8fee07773c", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "perfecto, está listo\n", "text_elements": []}]}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019eb3a5-07e3-7163-a098-145f9d55e5f3", "turn_id": "019ef341-7575-7e02-8817-1e77fe7a9af5", "item_id": "item-391", "rollout_ordinal": 3102, "created_at_ms": 1782197618876, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 3102, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-391", "text": "Buenísimo. Entonces ya queda listo para entregar: documento principal corregido, índices más presentables, anexos referenciados y respaldo disponible por si algo se mueve.\n\nAntes de subirlo, solo revisaría visualmente una vez en Word el salto entre portada, índices y capítulo 1. Pero por contenido y estructura, ya estás en buen terreno.", "phase": "final_answer", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019eb3a5-07e3-7163-a098-145f9d55e5f3", "turn_id": "019ef343-a72f-77a1-bb3c-56ec23dccb57", "item_id": "item-392", "rollout_ordinal": 3109, "created_at_ms": 1782197757843, "item_type": "userMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 3109, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "userMessage", "id": "item-392", "clientId": "2a41b7db-c9dd-4b04-b8fe-57adca020832", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "podrías pasar todo el documento a Latex?\n", "text_elements": []}]}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019eb3a5-07e3-7163-a098-145f9d55e5f3", "turn_id": "019ef343-a72f-77a1-bb3c-56ec23dccb57", "item_id": "item-393", "rollout_ordinal": 3111, "created_at_ms": 1782197775926, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 3111, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-393", "text": "Sí, puedo pasarlo a LaTeX. Voy a generar una carpeta aparte para no tocar tu Word final: extraeré texto, tablas e imágenes del `.docx`, crearé un `main.tex` compilable y dejaré las figuras en una subcarpeta.", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019eb3a5-07e3-7163-a098-145f9d55e5f3", "turn_id": "019ef343-a72f-77a1-bb3c-56ec23dccb57", "item_id": "item-394", "rollout_ordinal": 3114, "created_at_ms": 1782197786380, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 3114, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-394", "text": "También voy a hacer una conversión razonable, no una “foto” exacta del Word: LaTeX manejará automáticamente tabla de contenidos, índice de figuras e índice de tablas, y mantendré las referencias como sección numerada al final tal como están en tu documento.", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019eb3a5-07e3-7163-a098-145f9d55e5f3", "turn_id": "019ef343-a72f-77a1-bb3c-56ec23dccb57", "item_id": "item-395", "rollout_ordinal": 3117, "created_at_ms": 1782197800196, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 3117, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-395", "text": "Primero haré una inspección técnica del `.docx`: cuántas imágenes reales trae, cómo están intercaladas las tablas y si las leyendas aparecen como párrafos normales. Eso define qué tan fiel puede quedar el `.tex`.", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019eb3a5-07e3-7163-a098-145f9d55e5f3", "turn_id": "019ef343-a72f-77a1-bb3c-56ec23dccb57", "item_id": "item-396", "rollout_ordinal": 3127, "created_at_ms": 1782197873909, "item_type": "contextCompaction", "updated_at_ordinal": 3127, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "contextCompaction", "id": "item-396"}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019eb3a5-07e3-7163-a098-145f9d55e5f3", "turn_id": "019ef343-a72f-77a1-bb3c-56ec23dccb57", "item_id": "item-397", "rollout_ordinal": 3128, "created_at_ms": 1782197882215, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 3128, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-397", "text": "Sí. Voy a convertir el `.docx` principal a una carpeta LaTeX separada, manteniendo el Word intacto y generando `main.tex` con figuras/tablas extraídas para que puedas editarlo o compilarlo después.", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019eb3a5-07e3-7163-a098-145f9d55e5f3", "turn_id": "019ef343-a72f-77a1-bb3c-56ec23dccb57", "item_id": "item-398", "rollout_ordinal": 3140, "created_at_ms": 1782197928600, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 3140, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-398", "text": "Primero estoy verificando el entorno y el contenido del `.docx`. No veo un motor LaTeX instalado todavía, así que la conversión puede quedar lista aunque quizá no pueda compilar el PDF desde aquí sin instalar TeX.", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019eb3a5-07e3-7163-a098-145f9d55e5f3", "turn_id": "019ef343-a72f-77a1-bb3c-56ec23dccb57", "item_id": "item-399", "rollout_ordinal": 3154, "created_at_ms": 1782197984730, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 3154, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-399", "text": "Voy a crear un conversor local pequeño para no depender de Pandoc: extrae las imágenes del Word, salta los índices manuales y reconstruye portada, tabla de contenidos, índice de figuras/tablas y capítulos en LaTeX.", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019eb3a5-07e3-7163-a098-145f9d55e5f3", "turn_id": "019ef343-a72f-77a1-bb3c-56ec23dccb57", "item_id": "call_wcCQng23OSSYumAWXPIydqJi", "rollout_ordinal": 3157, "created_at_ms": 1782198054490, "item_type": "fileChange", "updated_at_ordinal": 3157, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "fileChange", "id": "call_wcCQng23OSSYumAWXPIydqJi", "changes": [{"path": "C:\\Users\\Diego Tapia\\Desktop\\Pene\\U\\Tesis\\tesis_karaoke\\docs\\convertir_docx_a_latex.py", "kind": {"type": "add"}, "diff": "from __future__ import annotations\n\nimport re\nimport shutil\nfrom pathlib import Path\n\nfrom docx import Document\nfrom docx.oxml.ns import qn\n\n\nROOT_13 = Path(r\"C:\\Users\\Diego Tapia\\Desktop\\Pene\\U\\13avo semestre\")\nFORMULACION = next(ROOT_13.glob(\"Formulaci*\"))\nDOC_DIR = FORMULACION / \"Informe final\" / \"Documento\"\nDOCX_PATH = DOC_DIR / \"Documento final.docx\"\nOUT_DIR = DOC_DIR / \"Documento_final_LaTeX\"\nFIG_DIR = OUT_DIR / \"figuras\"\n\n\nCHAPTERS = {\n    \"1. introducción\": \"Introducción\",\n    \"2. marco teórico y trabajo relacionado\": \"Marco teórico y trabajo relacionado\",\n    \"3. metodología\": \"Metodología\",\n    \"4. desarrollo\": \"Desarrollo\",\n}\n\n\nLATEX_SPECIALS = {\n    \"\\\\\": r\"\\textbackslash{}\",\n    \"&\": r\"\\&\",\n    \"%\": r\"\\%\",\n    \"$\": r\"\\$\",\n    \"#\": r\"\\#\",\n    \"_\": r\"\\_\",\n    \"{\": r\"\\{\",\n    \"}\": r\"\\}\",\n    \"~\": r\"\\textasciitilde{}\",\n    \"^\": r\"\\textasciicircum{}\",\n}\n\n\ndef clean_text(text: str) -> str:\n    return re.sub(r\"\\s+\", \" \", text.replace(\"\\xa0\", \" \")).strip()\n\n\ndef tex(text: str) -> str:\n    text = clean_text(text)\n    return \"\".join(LATEX_SPECIALS.get(ch, ch) for ch in text)\n\n\ndef image_rids_from_element(element) -> list[str]:\n    rids: list[str] = []\n    for node in element.iter():\n        if node.tag.endswith(\"}blip\"):\n            rid = node.get(qn(\"r:embed\")) or node.get(qn(\"r:link\"))\n            if rid and rid not in rids:\n                rids.append(rid)\n    return rids\n\n\ndef parse_caption(text: str, kind: str) -> tuple[str, str] | None:\n    label_name = \"Figura\" if kind == \"figure\" else \"Cuadro\"\n    match = re.match(\n        rf\"^{label_name}\\s+([0-9]+(?:\\.[0-9]+)*)\\s*:\\s*(.+)$\",\n        clean_text(text),\n        flags=re.IGNORECASE,\n    )\n    if not match:\n        return None\n    number = match.group(1)\n    body = match.group(2)\n    return number, body\n\n\ndef label_from_number(prefix: str, number: str) -> str:\n    return f\"{prefix}:{number.replace('.', '-')}\"\n\n\ndef body_elements(document: Document):\n    paragraphs = iter(document.paragraphs)\n    tables = iter(document.tables)\n    for child in document.element.body.iterchildren():\n        if child.tag == qn(\"w:p\"):\n            yield \"p\", next(paragraphs)\n        elif child.tag == qn(\"w:tbl\"):\n            yield \"t\", next(tables)\n\n\nclass LatexConverter:\n    def __init__(self, document: Document) -> None:\n        self.document = document\n        self.image_files: dict[str, str] = {}\n        self.figure_count = 0\n        self.table_count = 0\n\n    def write_image(self, rid: str) -> str:\n        if rid in self.image_files:\n            return self.image_files[rid]\n\n        image_part = self.document.part.related_parts[rid]\n        source_name = Path(str(image_part.partname)).name\n        safe_name = re.sub(r\"[^A-Za-z0-9_.-]\", \"_\", source_name)\n        target = FIG_DIR / safe_name\n\n        duplicate = 1\n        while target.exists() and target.read_bytes() != image_part.blob:\n            stem = Path(safe_name).stem\n            suffix = Path(safe_name).suffix\n            target = FIG_DIR / f\"{stem}_{duplicate}{suffix}\"\n            duplicate += 1\n\n        target.write_bytes(image_part.blob)\n        self.image_files[rid] = target.name\n        return target.name\n\n    def figure_block(\n        self,\n        rids: list[str],\n        caption: tuple[str, str] | None,\n    ) -> list[str]:\n        if not rids:\n            return []\n\n        self.figure_count += 1\n        lines = [r\"\\begin{figure}[H]\", r\"\\centering\"]\n        for rid in rids:\n            name = self.write_image(rid)\n            lines.append(\n                rf\"\\includegraphics[width=\\textwidth,height=0.72\\textheight,keepaspectratio]{{figuras/{name}}}\"\n            )\n        if caption:\n            number, body = caption\n            lines.append(rf\"\\caption{{{tex(body)}}}\")\n            lines.append(rf\"\\label{{{label_from_number('fig', number)}}}\")\n        lines.append(r\"\\end{figure}\")\n        lines.append(\"\")\n        return lines\n\n    def table_block(\n        self,\n        table,\n        caption: tuple[str, str] | None,\n    ) -> list[str]:\n        rows = table.rows\n        if not rows:\n            return []\n\n        column_count = max(len(row.cells) for row in rows)\n        if column_count == 0:\n            return []\n\n        self.table_count += 1\n        spec = \"|\" + \"|\".join(\n            [r\">{\\raggedright\\arraybackslash}X\" for _ in range(column_count)]\n        ) + \"|\"\n        lines = [r\"\\begin{table}[H]\", r\"\\centering\", r\"\\small\"]\n        if caption:\n            number, body = caption\n            lines.append(rf\"\\caption{{{tex(body)}}}\")\n            lines.append(rf\"\\label{{{label_from_number('tab', number)}}}\")\n        lines.append(rf\"\\begin{{tabularx}}{{\\textwidth}}{{{spec}}}\")\n        lines.append(r\"\\hline\")\n        for row in rows:\n            values = []\n            for idx in range(column_count):\n                value = \"\"\n                if idx < len(row.cells):\n                    value = row.cells[idx].text\n                value = tex(value).replace(\"\\n\", r\"\\newline \")\n                values.append(value)\n            lines.append(\" & \".join(values) + r\" \\\\\")\n            lines.append(r\"\\hline\")\n        lines.append(r\"\\end{tabularx}\")\n        lines.append(r\"\\end{table}\")\n        lines.append(\"\")\n        return lines\n\n\ndef heading_block(text_value: str) -> list[str] | None:\n    lowered = clean_text(text_value).lower()\n    if lowered in CHAPTERS:\n        return [rf\"\\chapter{{{tex(CHAPTERS[lowered])}}}\", \"\"]\n\n    subsection = re.match(r\"^\\d+\\.\\d+\\.\\d+\\.?\\s+(.+)$\", clean_text(text_value))\n    if subsection:\n        return [rf\"\\subsection{{{tex(subsection.group(1))}}}\", \"\"]\n\n    section = re.match(r\"^\\d+\\.\\d+\\.?\\s+(.+)$\", clean_text(text_value))\n    if section:\n        return [rf\"\\section{{{tex(section.group(1))}}}\", \"\"]\n\n    return None\n\n\ndef preamble(logo_name: str | None) -> list[str]:\n    lines = [\n        r\"\\documentclass[12pt,letterpaper]{report}\",\n        r\"\\usepackage[left=3cm,right=2.5cm,top=2.5cm,bottom=2.5cm]{geometry}\",\n        r\"\\usepackage{fontspec}\",\n        r\"\\setmainfont{Times New Roman}\",\n        r\"\\usepackage{polyglossia}\",\n        r\"\\setdefaultlanguage{spanish}\",\n        r\"\\usepackage{graphicx}\",\n        r\"\\usepackage{float}\",\n        r\"\\usepackage{caption}\",\n        r\"\\usepackage{array}\",\n        r\"\\usepackage{tabularx}\",\n        r\"\\usepackage{booktabs}\",\n        r\"\\usepackage{enumitem}\",\n        r\"\\usepackage{xurl}\",\n        r\"\\usepackage[hidelinks]{hyperref}\",\n        r\"\\usepackage{titlesec}\",\n        r\"\\titleformat{\\chapter}[hang]{\\normalfont\\bfseries\\Large}{\\thechapter.}{0.6em}{}\",\n        r\"\\titleformat{name=\\chapter,numberless}[hang]{\\normalfont\\bfseries\\Large}{}{0pt}{}\",\n        r\"\\titlespacing*{\\chapter}{0pt}{-0.5cm}{0.8cm}\",\n        r\"\\renewcommand{\\contentsname}{TABLA DE CONTENIDOS}\",\n        r\"\\renewcommand{\\listfigurename}{ÍNDICE DE FIGURAS}\",\n        r\"\\renewcommand{\\listtablename}{ÍNDICE DE TABLAS}\",\n        r\"\\renewcommand{\\tablename}{Cuadro}\",\n        r\"\\captionsetup{font=small,labelfont=bf}\",\n        r\"\\setlength{\\parindent}{1.25cm}\",\n        r\"\\setlength{\\parskip}{0.35em}\",\n        r\"\\sloppy\",\n        \"\",\n        r\"\\begin{document}\",\n        \"\",\n        r\"\\begin{titlepage}\",\n        r\"\\centering\",\n    ]\n    if logo_name:\n        lines.append(rf\"\\includegraphics[width=0.24\\textwidth]{{figuras/{logo_name}}}\\\\[0.8cm]\")\n    lines.extend(\n        [\n            r\"{\\bfseries UNIVERSIDAD DE TALCA\\par}\",\n            r\"{\\bfseries FACULTAD DE INGENIERÍA\\par}\",\n            r\"{\\bfseries ESCUELA DE INGENIERÍA CIVIL EN COMPUTACIÓN\\par}\",\n            r\"\\vfill\",\n            r\"{\\Large\\bfseries Sistema de análisis vocal, detección de patrones de error y retroalimentación basado en procesamiento digital de señales\\par}\",\n            r\"\\vspace{2.5cm}\",\n            r\"{\\bfseries DIEGO ALFONSO TAPIA VÁSQUEZ\\par}\",\n            r\"\\vfill\",\n            r\"{Curicó - Chile\\par}\",\n            r\"{Junio, 2026\\par}\",\n            r\"\\end{titlepage}\",\n            \"\",\n            r\"\\pagenumbering{roman}\",\n            r\"\\tableofcontents\",\n            r\"\\listoffigures\",\n            r\"\\listoftables\",\n            r\"\\clearpage\",\n            r\"\\pagenumbering{arabic}\",\n            \"\",\n        ]\n    )\n    return lines\n\n\ndef find_logo(document: Document, converter: LatexConverter) -> str | None:\n    for paragraph in document.paragraphs[:20]:\n        rids = image_rids_from_element(paragraph._p)\n        if rids:\n            return converter.write_image(rids[0])\n    return None\n\n\ndef convert() -> None:\n    if not DOCX_PATH.exists():\n        raise FileNotFoundError(DOCX_PATH)\n\n    if OUT_DIR.exists():\n        shutil.rmtree(OUT_DIR)\n    FIG_DIR.mkdir(parents=True, exist_ok=True)\n\n    document = Document(DOCX_PATH)\n    converter = LatexConverter(document)\n    logo_name = find_logo(document, converter)\n\n    elements = list(body_elements(document))\n    lines = preamble(logo_name)\n\n    started = False\n    in_references = False\n    references_open = False\n    i = 0\n    while i < len(elements):\n        kind, item = elements[i]\n\n        if kind == \"p\":\n            paragraph = item\n            text_value = clean_text(paragraph.text)\n            rids = image_rids_from_element(paragraph._p)\n\n            if not started:\n                if text_value == \"1. Introducción\":\n                    started = True\n                else:\n                    i += 1\n                    continue\n\n            if rids:\n                caption = parse_caption(text_value, \"figure\")\n                consume_next = False\n                if caption is None and i + 1 < len(elements) and elements[i + 1][0] == \"p\":\n                    next_text = clean_text(elements[i + 1][1].text)\n                    caption = parse_caption(next_text, \"figure\")\n                    consume_next = caption is not None\n                lines.extend(converter.figure_block(rids, caption))\n                i += 2 if consume_next else 1\n                continue\n\n            if not text_value:\n                i += 1\n                continue\n\n            if text_value == \"Referencias\":\n                if references_open:\n                    lines.extend([r\"\\end{enumerate}\", \"\"])\n                    references_open = False\n                lines.extend(\n                    [\n                        r\"\\chapter*{Referencias}\",\n                        r\"\\addcontentsline{toc}{chapter}{Referencias}\",\n                        \"\",\n                    ]\n                )\n                in_references = True\n                i += 1\n                continue\n\n            if text_value == \"Anexos\":\n                if references_open:\n                    lines.extend([r\"\\end{enumerate}\", \"\"])\n                    references_open = False\n                in_references = False\n                lines.extend(\n                    [\n                        r\"\\chapter*{Anexos}\",\n                        r\"\\addcontentsline{toc}{chapter}{Anexos}\",\n                        \"\",\n                    ]\n                )\n                i += 1\n                continue\n\n            if in_references:\n                ref_match = re.match(r\"^\\[(\\d+)\\]\\s*(.+)$\", text_value)\n                if ref_match:\n                    if not references_open:\n                        lines.extend(\n                            [\n                                r\"\\begin{enumerate}[label={[\\arabic*]},leftmargin=*]\",\n                                \"\",\n                            ]\n                        )\n                        references_open = True\n                    lines.append(rf\"\\item {tex(ref_match.group(2))}\")\n                    lines.append(\"\")\n                else:\n                    if references_open:\n                        lines.extend([r\"\\end{enumerate}\", \"\"])\n                        references_open = False\n                    lines.extend([tex(text_value), \"\"])\n                i += 1\n                continue\n\n            if parse_caption(text_value, \"figure\") or parse_caption(text_value, \"table\"):\n                i += 1\n                continue\n\n            heading = heading_block(text_value)\n            if heading:\n                lines.extend(heading)\n            else:\n                lines.extend([tex(text_value), \"\"])\n            i += 1\n            continue\n\n        table = item\n        if not started:\n            i += 1\n            continue\n\n        table_rids = image_rids_from_element(table._tbl)\n        if table_rids:\n            caption = None\n            consume_next = False\n            if i + 1 < len(elements) and elements[i + 1][0] == \"p\":\n                next_text = clean_text(elements[i + 1][1].text)\n                caption = parse_caption(next_text, \"figure\")\n                consume_next = caption is not None\n            lines.extend(converter.figure_block(table_rids, caption))\n            i += 2 if consume_next else 1\n            continue\n\n        caption = None\n        consume_next = False\n        if i + 1 < len(elements) and elements[i + 1][0] == \"p\":\n            next_text = clean_text(elements[i + 1][1].text)\n            caption = parse_caption(next_text, \"table\")\n            consume_next = caption is not None\n        lines.extend(converter.table_block(table, caption))\n        i += 2 if consume_next else 1\n\n    if references_open:\n        lines.extend([r\"\\end{enumerate}\", \"\"])\n\n    lines.extend([r\"\\end{document}\", \"\"])\n    (OUT_DIR / \"main.tex\").write_text(\"\\n\".join(lines), encoding=\"utf-8\")\n    (OUT_DIR / \"README.txt\").write_text(\n        \"Documento convertido desde Documento final.docx.\\n\"\n        \"Compilación recomendada: xelatex main.tex, ejecutar dos veces para actualizar índices.\\n\"\n        \"La carpeta figuras contiene las imágenes extraídas desde el documento Word.\\n\",\n        encoding=\"utf-8\",\n    )\n\n    print(f\"DOCX: {DOCX_PATH}\")\n    print(f\"Salida: {OUT_DIR}\")\n    print(f\"Imagenes extraidas: {len(converter.image_files)}\")\n    print(f\"Figuras generadas: {converter.figure_count}\")\n    print(f\"Tablas generadas: {converter.table_count}\")\n\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    convert()\n"}], "status": "completed"}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019eb3a5-07e3-7163-a098-145f9d55e5f3", "turn_id": "019ef343-a72f-77a1-bb3c-56ec23dccb57", "item_id": "item-400", "rollout_ordinal": 3161, "created_at_ms": 1782198057842, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 3161, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-400", "text": "Ya dejé listo el script de conversión. Ahora lo ejecuto y luego revisaré rápidamente el `.tex` generado para asegurar que parta desde el capítulo 1 real y no desde los índices manuales del Word.", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019eb3a5-07e3-7163-a098-145f9d55e5f3", "turn_id": "019ef343-a72f-77a1-bb3c-56ec23dccb57", "item_id": "item-401", "rollout_ordinal": 3167, "created_at_ms": 1782198069821, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 3167, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-401", "text": "La conversión corrió bien: extrajo 16 imágenes, generó 15 figuras y 12 tablas. Haré una pasada de control sobre el archivo LaTeX para detectar errores obvios antes de dártelo.", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019eb3a5-07e3-7163-a098-145f9d55e5f3", "turn_id": "019ef343-a72f-77a1-bb3c-56ec23dccb57", "item_id": "item-402", "rollout_ordinal": 3177, "created_at_ms": 1782198083955, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 3177, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-402", "text": "El control muestra que la estructura quedó bien: capítulos, secciones, figuras, tablas, referencias y anexos están presentes. Voy a ajustar un detalle de compatibilidad en la fuente para que compile mejor tanto en Windows como en Overleaf.", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019eb3a5-07e3-7163-a098-145f9d55e5f3", "turn_id": "019ef343-a72f-77a1-bb3c-56ec23dccb57", "item_id": "call_2gmExQn7E7tVD6iYXSk3ncMD", "rollout_ordinal": 3180, "created_at_ms": 1782198085612, "item_type": "fileChange", "updated_at_ordinal": 3180, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "fileChange", "id": "call_2gmExQn7E7tVD6iYXSk3ncMD", "changes": [{"path": "C:\\Users\\Diego Tapia\\Desktop\\Pene\\U\\Tesis\\tesis_karaoke\\docs\\convertir_docx_a_latex.py", "kind": {"type": "update", "move_path": null}, "diff": "@@ -198,3 +198,3 @@\n         r\"\\usepackage{fontspec}\",\n-        r\"\\setmainfont{Times New Roman}\",\n+        r\"\\IfFontExistsTF{Times New Roman}{\\setmainfont{Times New Roman}}{\\setmainfont{TeX Gyre Termes}}\",\n         r\"\\usepackage{polyglossia}\",\n"}], "status": "completed"}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019eb3a5-07e3-7163-a098-145f9d55e5f3", "turn_id": "019ef343-a72f-77a1-bb3c-56ec23dccb57", "item_id": "item-403", "rollout_ordinal": 3183, "created_at_ms": 1782198093483, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 3183, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-403", "text": "El ajuste quedó en el generador; regenero el paquete LaTeX para que el `main.tex` final incluya ese cambio y no arrastre la versión anterior.", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019eb3a5-07e3-7163-a098-145f9d55e5f3", "turn_id": "019ef343-a72f-77a1-bb3c-56ec23dccb57", "item_id": "item-404", "rollout_ordinal": 3189, "created_at_ms": 1782198104957, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 3189, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-404", "text": "Ahora intentaré compilarlo si hay motor LaTeX disponible. Si no está instalado, igual quedará la carpeta lista para abrirla en Overleaf o compilarla con TeX Live/MiKTeX.", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019eb3a5-07e3-7163-a098-145f9d55e5f3", "turn_id": "019ef343-a72f-77a1-bb3c-56ec23dccb57", "item_id": "item-405", "rollout_ordinal": 3195, "created_at_ms": 1782198119078, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 3195, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-405", "text": "No hay `xelatex` instalado en este entorno, así que no pude generar el PDF localmente. El paquete LaTeX sí quedó armado; haré además un `.zip` para que puedas subirlo completo a Overleaf si te acomoda.", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019eb3a5-07e3-7163-a098-145f9d55e5f3", "turn_id": "019ef343-a72f-77a1-bb3c-56ec23dccb57", "item_id": "item-406", "rollout_ordinal": 3201, "created_at_ms": 1782198130862, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 3201, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-406", "text": "El primer intento de comprimir no tomó bien el comodín de PowerShell. Lo repito con una forma más directa para generar el paquete.", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019eb3a5-07e3-7163-a098-145f9d55e5f3", "turn_id": "019ef343-a72f-77a1-bb3c-56ec23dccb57", "item_id": "item-407", "rollout_ordinal": 3213, "created_at_ms": 1782198152878, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 3213, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-407", "text": "La validación encontró que casi todo está en UTF-8 correcto, pero aparecen unos pocos caracteres mojibake en texto fijo del preámbulo/portada generado. Voy a corregirlos para que el archivo no tenga rarezas de codificación.", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019eb3a5-07e3-7163-a098-145f9d55e5f3", "turn_id": "019ef343-a72f-77a1-bb3c-56ec23dccb57", "item_id": "item-408", "rollout_ordinal": 3219, "created_at_ms": 1782198162145, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 3219, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-408", "text": "Falsa alarma: el chequeo anterior confundió signos de apertura de pregunta con caracteres raros por cómo PowerShell leyó el script en línea. Confirmo con códigos Unicode y cierro la revisión.", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019eb3a5-07e3-7163-a098-145f9d55e5f3", "turn_id": "019ef343-a72f-77a1-bb3c-56ec23dccb57", "item_id": "item-409", "rollout_ordinal": 3225, "created_at_ms": 1782198172022, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 3225, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-409", "text": "El archivo quedó limpio de problemas de codificación. Haré una última comprobación de motores LaTeX disponibles para dejarte una indicación honesta sobre la compilación local.", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019eb3a5-07e3-7163-a098-145f9d55e5f3", "turn_id": "019ef343-a72f-77a1-bb3c-56ec23dccb57", "item_id": "item-410", "rollout_ordinal": 3231, "created_at_ms": 1782198187074, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 3231, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-410", "text": "La estructura general está, pero noto algo importante: no todas las tablas parecen haber quedado con `\\caption`, lo que afectaría el índice de tablas. Voy a revisar esa parte y corregir el conversor si las leyendas estaban antes de algunas tablas en el Word.", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019eb3a5-07e3-7163-a098-145f9d55e5f3", "turn_id": "019ef343-a72f-77a1-bb3c-56ec23dccb57", "item_id": "item-411", "rollout_ordinal": 3237, "created_at_ms": 1782198198263, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 3237, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-411", "text": "Efectivamente, varias tablas existen pero no tienen leyenda asociada en el `.tex`. Voy a mirar el orden real de tabla/leyenda en el Word para recuperar esos títulos desde los párrafos cercanos o desde el índice, si hace falta.", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019eb3a5-07e3-7163-a098-145f9d55e5f3", "turn_id": "019ef343-a72f-77a1-bb3c-56ec23dccb57", "item_id": "item-412", "rollout_ordinal": 3243, "created_at_ms": 1782198211047, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 3243, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-412", "text": "Ese chequeo no encontró el punto de inicio por el acento leído desde PowerShell; lo repito usando códigos Unicode para evitar esa trampa.", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019eb3a5-07e3-7163-a098-145f9d55e5f3", "turn_id": "019ef343-a72f-77a1-bb3c-56ec23dccb57", "item_id": "item-413", "rollout_ordinal": 3249, "created_at_ms": 1782198226811, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 3249, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-413", "text": "Encontré la causa: varias leyendas de tablas estaban después de un párrafo vacío, así que el conversor no las asociaba. Haré que busque la siguiente leyenda no vacía y regenere todo; ese detalle sí vale la pena dejarlo fino.", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019eb3a5-07e3-7163-a098-145f9d55e5f3", "turn_id": "019ef343-a72f-77a1-bb3c-56ec23dccb57", "item_id": "call_Pf66dtSBtLqhR9HgOXhFF8Dl", "rollout_ordinal": 3252, "created_at_ms": 1782198239849, "item_type": "fileChange", "updated_at_ordinal": 3252, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "fileChange", "id": "call_Pf66dtSBtLqhR9HgOXhFF8Dl", "changes": [{"path": "C:\\Users\\Diego Tapia\\Desktop\\Pene\\U\\Tesis\\tesis_karaoke\\docs\\convertir_docx_a_latex.py", "kind": {"type": "update", "move_path": null}, "diff": "@@ -193,2 +193,23 @@\n \n+def find_next_caption(\n+    elements: list[tuple[str, object]],\n+    index: int,\n+    kind: str,\n+) -> tuple[tuple[str, str] | None, int | None]:\n+    cursor = index + 1\n+    while cursor < len(elements):\n+        next_kind, next_item = elements[cursor]\n+        if next_kind != \"p\":\n+            return None, None\n+        next_text = clean_text(next_item.text)\n+        if not next_text:\n+            cursor += 1\n+            continue\n+        caption = parse_caption(next_text, kind)\n+        if caption:\n+            return caption, cursor\n+        return None, None\n+    return None, None\n+\n+\n def preamble(logo_name: str | None) -> list[str]:\n@@ -300,9 +321,7 @@\n                 caption = parse_caption(text_value, \"figure\")\n-                consume_next = False\n-                if caption is None and i + 1 < len(elements) and elements[i + 1][0] == \"p\":\n-                    next_text = clean_text(elements[i + 1][1].text)\n-                    caption = parse_caption(next_text, \"figure\")\n-                    consume_next = caption is not None\n+                consume_to = None\n+                if caption is None:\n+                    caption, consume_to = find_next_caption(elements, i, \"figure\")\n                 lines.extend(converter.figure_block(rids, caption))\n-                i += 2 if consume_next else 1\n+                i = (consume_to + 1) if consume_to is not None else i + 1\n                 continue\n@@ -384,9 +403,6 @@\n             caption = None\n-            consume_next = False\n-            if i + 1 < len(elements) and elements[i + 1][0] == \"p\":\n-                next_text = clean_text(elements[i + 1][1].text)\n-                caption = parse_caption(next_text, \"figure\")\n-                consume_next = caption is not None\n+            consume_to = None\n+            caption, consume_to = find_next_caption(elements, i, \"figure\")\n             lines.extend(converter.figure_block(table_rids, caption))\n-            i += 2 if consume_next else 1\n+            i = (consume_to + 1) if consume_to is not None else i + 1\n             continue\n@@ -394,9 +410,6 @@\n         caption = None\n-        consume_next = False\n-        if i + 1 < len(elements) and elements[i + 1][0] == \"p\":\n-            next_text = clean_text(elements[i + 1][1].text)\n-            caption = parse_caption(next_text, \"table\")\n-            consume_next = caption is not None\n+        consume_to = None\n+        caption, consume_to = find_next_caption(elements, i, \"table\")\n         lines.extend(converter.table_block(table, caption))\n-        i += 2 if consume_next else 1\n+        i = (consume_to + 1) if consume_to is not None else i + 1\n \n"}], "status": "completed"}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019eb3a5-07e3-7163-a098-145f9d55e5f3", "turn_id": "019ef343-a72f-77a1-bb3c-56ec23dccb57", "item_id": "item-414", "rollout_ordinal": 3256, "created_at_ms": 1782198242887, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 3256, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-414", "text": "El conversor ya entiende las leyendas separadas por líneas vacías. Regenero el paquete y revisaré que el índice de tablas pueda formarse con todas las captions.", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019eb3a5-07e3-7163-a098-145f9d55e5f3", "turn_id": "019ef343-a72f-77a1-bb3c-56ec23dccb57", "item_id": "item-415", "rollout_ordinal": 3261, "created_at_ms": 1782198256355, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 3261, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-415", "text": "Ahora vuelvo a contar captions y luego actualizo el `.zip` final.", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019eb3a5-07e3-7163-a098-145f9d55e5f3", "turn_id": "019ef343-a72f-77a1-bb3c-56ec23dccb57", "item_id": "item-416", "rollout_ordinal": 3273, "created_at_ms": 1782198286730, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 3273, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-416", "text": "Listo, pasé el documento a LaTeX sin tocar el Word original.\n\nQuedó aquí:\n\n- [main.tex](<C:/Users/Diego Tapia/Desktop/Pene/U/13avo semestre/Formulación/Informe final/Documento/Documento_final_LaTeX/main.tex>)\n- [carpeta LaTeX](<C:/Users/Diego Tapia/Desktop/Pene/U/13avo semestre/Formulación/Informe final/Documento/Documento_final_LaTeX>)\n- [zip para Overleaf](<C:/Users/Diego Tapia/Desktop/Pene/U/13avo semestre/Formulación/Informe final/Documento/Documento_final_LaTeX.zip>)\n\nTambién dejé el conversor por si después editamos el Word y quieres regenerarlo: [convertir_docx_a_latex.py](<C:/Users/Diego Tapia/Desktop/Pene/U/Tesis/tesis_karaoke/docs/convertir_docx_a_latex.py>).\n\nValidé que quedaran `15` figuras, `12` tablas con caption, `30` referencias y sin problemas de codificación. No pude compilar el PDF acá porque no hay `xelatex`, `lualatex` ni `pdflatex` instalados en el entorno. Para compilarlo, lo ideal es subir el `.zip` a Overleaf o ejecutar `xelatex main.tex` dos veces en una instalación local de TeX.", "phase": "final_answer", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019eb3a5-07e3-7163-a098-145f9d55e5f3", "turn_id": "019ef34b-bbae-7a13-8114-8f97efbf989e", "item_id": "item-417", "rollout_ordinal": 3280, "created_at_ms": 1782198287378, "item_type": "userMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 3280, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "userMessage", "id": "item-417", "clientId": "818c44b3-a240-40b7-a17c-96355b01ccc2", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "hazlo en overleaf de ser posible\n", "text_elements": []}]}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019eb3a5-07e3-7163-a098-145f9d55e5f3", "turn_id": "019ef34b-bbae-7a13-8114-8f97efbf989e", "item_id": "item-418", "rollout_ordinal": 3282, "created_at_ms": 1782198294401, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 3282, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-418", "text": "Puedo intentarlo. Voy a usar el navegador integrado para abrir Overleaf y, si ya tienes sesión iniciada, subir el `.zip` que dejé listo; si pide login o permisos, te avisaré justo ahí.", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019eb3a5-07e3-7163-a098-145f9d55e5f3", "turn_id": "019ef34b-bbae-7a13-8114-8f97efbf989e", "item_id": "item-419", "rollout_ordinal": 3292, "created_at_ms": 1782198304327, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 3292, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-419", "text": "Voy a abrir Overleaf desde el navegador integrado. Como subir el `.zip` transmite el documento a un servicio externo, asumiré que tu “hazlo en Overleaf” autoriza esa subida concreta del paquete `Documento_final_LaTeX.zip`.", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019eb3a5-07e3-7163-a098-145f9d55e5f3", "turn_id": "019ef34b-bbae-7a13-8114-8f97efbf989e", "item_id": "call_JynHvkbmbOLRCGsCKiDzmj5x", "rollout_ordinal": 3295, "created_at_ms": 1782198309512, "item_type": "mcpToolCall", "updated_at_ordinal": 3295, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "mcpToolCall", "id": "call_JynHvkbmbOLRCGsCKiDzmj5x", "server": "node_repl", "tool": "js", "status": "completed", "arguments": {"code": "var browserClientModulePath = 'file:///C:/Users/Diego%20Tapia/.codex/plugins/cache/openai-bundled/browser/26.616.51431/scripts/browser-client.mjs';\nvar { setupBrowserRuntime } = await import(browserClientModulePath);\nawait setupBrowserRuntime({ globals: globalThis });\nglobalThis.browser = await agent.browsers.get('iab');\nnodeRepl.write(await browser.documentation());", "timeout_ms": 30000, "title": "Conectar navegador"}, "appContext": null, "mcpAppUi": null, "pluginId": null, "readOnlyHint": null, "result": {"content": [{"type": "text", "text": "## Additional Capabilities\n### Browser Capabilities\n- `visibility`: Use to show or hide the browser to the user, and to determine the browser's current visibility. Keep browser work in the background unless the user asks to see it or live viewing is useful. When the browser should be visible, call set(true).\n  Read with `await (await browser.capabilities.get(\"visibility\")).documentation()`.\n- `viewport`: Controls an explicit browser viewport override for responsive or device-size testing. Use it when a task calls for specific dimensions or breakpoint validation; otherwise leave it unset so the browser uses its normal 1280x720 viewport. Reset temporary overrides before finishing unless the user asked to keep them.\n  Read with `await (await browser.capabilities.get(\"viewport\")).documentation()`.\n### Tab Capabilities\n- `pageAssets`: List assets already observed in the current page state and bundle selected assets into a temporary local artifact.\n  Read with `await (await tab.capabilities.get(\"pageAssets\")).documentation()`.\n\n## Playwright\r\n\r\nPlaywright is a critical part of the JavaScript API available to you.\r\n\r\nYou only have access to a limited subset of the Playwright API, so only call functions that are explicitly defined.\r\nYou do have access to `tab.playwright.evaluate(...)`, but only in a read-only page scope.\r\nUse locators for scoped interactions and targeted checks. For bulk DOM inspection, prefer one bounded read-only `evaluate(...)` that queries and projects the needed data. Avoid loops of locator property calls. In `evaluate(...)`, use basic DOM reads, limit returned elements, and do not assume globals or helpers such as `performance`, `NodeFilter`, `document.createTreeWalker`, or `FormData` exist.\r\n\r\nWhen using Playwright, keep and reuse a recent `tab.playwright.domSnapshot()` when it is available and you need it for locator construction or retry decisions. Treat the latest relevant snapshot as the source of truth for locator construction and retry decisions.\r\n\r\n### Snapshot Discipline\r\n\r\n- Keep and reuse the latest relevant `domSnapshot()` until it proves stale or you need locator ground truth for UI that was not present in it.\r\n- Take a fresh `domSnapshot()` after navigation when you need to orient yourself or construct locators on the new page.\r\n- If a click times out, strict mode fails, or a selector parse error occurs, take a fresh `domSnapshot()` before forming the next locator.\r\n- Construct locators only from what appears in the latest snapshot. Do not guess labels, accessible names, or selectors.\r\n- Do not print full snapshot text repeatedly when a smaller excerpt, a `count()`, a specific attribute, or a direct locator check would answer the question with fewer tokens.\r\n- Do not discover page content by iterating through many results, cards, links, or rows and reading their text or attributes one by one.\r\n- Do not loop over a broad locator with `all()` and call `getAttribute(...)`, `textContent()`, or `innerText()` on each match. Each read crosses the browser boundary and becomes extremely expensive on large pages.\r\n- `locator.getAttribute(...)` is a single-element read, not a batch read. If the locator matches multiple elements, expect a strict-mode error rather than an array of attributes.\r\n- Use one broad observation to orient yourself: usually one fresh snapshot, or one screenshot if the visual structure is clearer than the DOM.\r\n- After that orientation step, narrow to the relevant section or a small number of strong candidates.\r\n- If the page is not getting narrower, do not scale up extraction across more elements. Change strategy instead.\r\n- Do not use `locator(...).allTextContents()`, `locator(\"body\").textContent()`, or `locator(\"body\").innerText()` as exploratory search tools across a page or large container.\r\n- Use broad text or attribute extraction only after you have already identified the exact container or element you need, and only when a smaller scoped check would not answer the question.\r\n- When you need many links, media URLs, or result titles, prefer a single `domSnapshot()` and parse the relevant lines, use the site's own search/filter UI, or navigate directly to a focused results page. Only fall back to per-element reads for a small, already-scoped set of candidates.\r\n- Do not use large body-text dumps, embedded app-state JSON such as `__NEXT_DATA__`, or repeated full-page extraction across multiple candidate pages as an exploratory search strategy.\r\n- Use large text or embedded JSON extraction only after you have already identified the relevant page, or when a site-specific skill explicitly depends on it.\r\n\r\n### Hard Constraints For Playwright In This Runtime\r\n\r\n- Do not pass a regex as `name` to `getByRole(...)` in this environment. Use a plain string `name` only.\r\n- Do not use `.first()`, `.last()`, or `.nth()` unless you have just called `count()` on the same locator and explicitly confirmed why that position is correct.\r\n- Do not click, fill, or press on a locator until you have verified it resolves to exactly one element when uniqueness is not obvious.\r\n- Do not retry the same failing locator without a fresh `domSnapshot()`.\r\n- Do not use a guessed locator as an exploratory probe. If the latest snapshot does not clearly support the locator, do not spend timeout budget testing it.\r\n- Do not assume browser-side Playwright supports the full upstream API surface. If a method is not explicitly known to exist, do not call it.\r\n- Do not assume `locator(...).selectOption(...)` exists in this environment.\r\n\r\n### Required Interaction Recipe\r\n\r\nBefore every click, fill, select-like action, or press:\r\n\r\n1. Reuse the latest relevant `domSnapshot()` when it still contains the locator ground truth you need. Take a fresh one only when it does not.\r\n2. Build the most stable locator from the latest snapshot.\r\n3. If uniqueness is not obvious from the selector itself, call `count()` on that locator.\r\n4. Proceed only if the locator resolves to exactly one element.\r\n5. Perform the action.\r\n6. After the action, collect another observation only when the next decision requires it. Prefer a targeted state check when it answers the question; take a fresh snapshot when you need new locator ground truth.\r\n\r\nIf `count()` is `0`:\r\n\r\n- The selector is wrong, stale, hidden, or the UI state is not ready.\r\n- Do not click anyway.\r\n- Do not wait on that locator to see if it eventually works.\r\n- Re-snapshot and rebuild the locator.\r\n\r\nIf `count()` is greater than `1`:\r\n\r\n- The selector is ambiguous.\r\n- Scope to the correct container or switch to a stronger attribute.\r\n- Do not use `.first()` as a shortcut.\r\n\r\n### Locator Strategy\r\n\r\nBuild locators from what the snapshot actually shows, not what looks visually obvious.\r\n\r\nPrefer the most stable contract, in this order:\r\n\r\n1. `data-testid`\r\n2. Stable `data-*` attributes\r\n3. Stable `href` (prefer exact or strong matches over broad substrings)\r\n4. Scoped semantic role + accessible name using a string `name`\r\n5. Scoped `getByText(...)`\r\n6. Scoped CSS selectors via `locator(...)`\r\n7. A scoped DOM-based click path or node-ID-based click when Playwright cannot produce a unique stable locator\r\n\r\nUse the most specific locator that is still durable.\r\n\r\nTreat a stable `href` as a strong hint, not proof of uniqueness. If multiple elements share the same `href`, scope to the correct card or container and confirm `count()` before clicking.\r\n\r\nTreat generic labels like `Menu`, `Main Menu`, `Help`, `Close`, `Default`, `Color`, `Size`, single-letter size labels such as `S`, `M`, `L`, `XL`, `Sort by`, `Search`, and `Add to cart` as ambiguous by default. Scope them to the correct container before acting.\r\n\r\nOn search results, product grids, carousels, and modal-heavy pages, repeated `href`s and repeated generic labels are ambiguous by default. First identify the stable card or container, then scope the locator inside that container before clicking.\r\n\r\n### Using `getByRole(..., { name })`\r\n\r\n- `name` is the accessible name, which may differ from visible text.\r\n- In the snapshot:\r\n  - `link \"X\"` usually reflects the accessible name.\r\n  - Nested text may be visible text only.\r\n- Use `getByRole` only when the accessible name is clearly present and likely unique in the latest snapshot.\r\n\r\n### Interaction Best Practices\r\n\r\n- Scope before acting: find the right container or section first, then target the child element.\r\n- If you call `count()` on a locator, store the result in a local variable and reuse it unless the DOM changes.\r\n- Match the locator to the actual element type shown in the snapshot (link vs button vs menuitem vs generic text).\r\n- Do not assume every click navigates. If opening a menu or filter, wait for the expected UI state, not page load.\r\n- Prefer structured local signals such as selected control state, visible confirmation text, modal contents, a specific line item, or URL parameters over scraping broad result sections or dumping large parts of the page.\r\n- Do not add explicit `timeoutMs` to routine `click`, `fill`, `check`, or `setChecked` calls unless you have a concrete reason the target is slow to become actionable.\r\n- Reserve explicit timeout values for navigation, state transitions, or other known slow operations.\r\n- If you already know the exact destination URL and no click-side effect matters, prefer `tab.goto(url)` over a brittle locator click.\r\n- Do not reacquire `tab` inside each `node_repl` call. Reuse the existing `tab` binding to save tokens and preserve state. Only reacquire or reassign it when you intentionally switch tabs, after a kernel reset, or after a failed call that did not create the binding.\r\n- Do not use fixed sleeps as a default waiting strategy. After an action, prefer a concrete state check or targeted wait. Take a fresh snapshot when you need new locator ground truth.\r\n- If a fixed delay is truly unavoidable for a known transition, keep it short and follow it immediately with a specific verification step.\r\n\r\n### Error Recovery\r\n\r\n- A strict mode violation means your locator is ambiguous.\r\n- Do not retry the same locator after a strict mode violation.\r\n- After strict mode fails, immediately inspect a fresh snapshot and rebuild the locator using tighter scope, a disambiguating container, or a stable attribute.\r\n- If a checkbox or radio exists but `check()` or `setChecked()` reports that it is hidden or did not change state, stop retrying the underlying input. Click its scoped visible associated `label[for]` or enclosing visible control once, then verify checked state.\r\n- A selector parse error means the locator syntax is invalid in this runtime.\r\n- Do not reuse the same locator form after a selector parse error.\r\n- A timeout usually means the target is missing, hidden, stale, offscreen, not yet rendered, or the selector is too broad.\r\n- Do not retry the same locator immediately after a timeout.\r\n- After a timeout, take a fresh snapshot, confirm the target still exists, and then either refine the locator or fall back to a more stable attribute.\r\n- If role or accessible-name targeting is unstable, fall back deliberately to a stable attribute (`data-*`, `href`, etc.), not brittle CSS structure.\r\n- If two locator attempts fail on the same target, stop escalating complexity on role or text locators. Switch to the most stable visible attribute from the snapshot or use a scoped DOM-based click path.\r\n\r\n### Fallback Guidance\r\n\r\n- Prefer stable `href` values copied from the snapshot over guessed URL patterns.\r\n- Prefer scoped attribute selectors over global text selectors.\r\n- Use `getByText(...)` only when role-based or attribute-based locators are not reliable, and scope it to a container whenever possible.\r\n- Prefer attributes copied directly from the latest snapshot over inferred semantics, fragile CSS chains, or positional selectors.\r\n- Do not invent likely selectors. If the snapshot does not clearly expose a unique target, fetch a fresh snapshot and reassess before acting.\n\n\n## API Reference\nUse this as the supported `agent.browsers.*` surface.\n\n```ts\n// Installed by setupBrowserRuntime({ globals: globalThis }).\nconst browser = await agent.browsers.get(\"iab\");\ninterface Agent {\n  browsers: Browsers; // API for finding and selecting browsers.\n  documentation: Documentation; // API for reading packaged browser-use documentation by name.\n}\n\ninterface Browsers {\n  get(id: string): Promise<Browser>; // Get a browser by id or client type.\n  list(): Promise<Array<{ capabilities: { browser?: Array<{ description: string; id: string }>; tab?: Array<{ description: string; id: string }> }; id: string; metadata?: Record<string, string>; name: string; type: \"iab\" | \"extension\" | \"cdp\" }>>; // List available browsers.\n}\n\ninterface Browser {\n  browserId: string; // Browser id selected by `agent.browsers.get()`.\n  capabilities: BrowserCapabilityCollection; // Browser-scoped optional capabilities advertised by the connected backend; discover IDs with `await browser.capabilities.list()`, then call `await (await browser.capabilities.get(id)).documentation()` for method details.\n  tabs: Tabs; // API for interacting with browser tabs.\n  user: BrowserUser; // Readonly context about tabs in the user's browser windows.\n  documentation(): Promise<string>; // Read browser guidance and the core API reference.\n  nameSession(name: string): Promise<void>; // Name the current browser automation session.\n}\n\ninterface BrowserUser {\n  claimTab(tab: string | BrowserUserTabInfo): Promise<Tab>; // Claim a user tab returned by `openTabs()` and return it as a controllable agent tab.\n\n  openTabs(): Promise<Array<BrowserUserTabInfo>>; // List open top-level tabs across the user's browser windows ordered by `lastOpened` descending.\n}\n\ninterface Tabs {\n\n  finalize(options: FinalizeTabsOptions): Promise<void>; // Finalize the browser session's tabs by cleaning up tabs that are no longer needed.\n  get(id: string): Promise<Tab>; // Get a tab by id.\n  list(): Promise<Array<TabInfo>>; // List open tabs in the browser.\n  new(): Promise<Tab>; // Create and return a new tab in the browser.\n  selected(): Promise<undefined | Tab>; // Return the currently selected tab, if any.\n}\n\ninterface Tab {\n  capabilities: TabCapabilityCollection; // Tab-scoped optional capabilities advertised by the connected backend; discover IDs with `await tab.capabilities.list()`, then call `await (await tab.capabilities.get(id)).documentation()` for method details.\n  clipboard: TabClipboardAPI; // API for interacting with the browser session's clipboard.\n\n  cua: CUAAPI; // API for interacting with the tab via the cua api\n  dev: TabDevAPI; // API for developer-oriented tab inspection.\n  dom_cua: DomCUAAPI; // API for interacting with the tab via the dom based cua api\n  id: string; // A tab's unique identifier\n  playwright: PlaywrightAPI; // API for interacting with the tab via the playwright api\n  back(): Promise<void>; // Navigate this tab back in history.\n  close(): Promise<void>; // Close this tab.\n  forward(): Promise<void>; // Navigate this tab forward in history.\n  getJsDialog(): Promise<undefined | Dialog>; // Get the active JavaScript dialog for this tab, if one is currently open.\n  goto(url: string): Promise<void>; // Open a URL in this tab.\n  reload(): Promise<void>; // Reload this tab.\n  screenshot(options: ScreenshotOptions): Promise<Uint8Array>; // Capture a screenshot of this tab.\n  title(): Promise<undefined | string>; // Get the current title for this tab.\n  url(): Promise<undefined | string>; // Get the current URL for this tab.\n}\n\ninterface CUAAPI {\n  click(options: ClickOptions): Promise<void>; // Click at a coordinate in the current viewport.\n  double_click(options: DoubleClickOptions): Promise<void>; // Double click at a coordinate in the current viewport.\n  \n  drag(options: DragOptions): Promise<void>; // Drag from a point to a point by the provided path.\n  keypress(options: KeypressOptions): Promise<void>; // Press control characters at the current focused element (focus it first via click/dblclick).\n  move(options: MoveOptions): Promise<void>; // Move the mouse to a point by the provided x and y coordinates.\n  scroll(options: ScrollOptions): Promise<void>; // Scroll by a delta from a specific viewport coordinate.\n  type(options: TypeOptions): Promise<void>; // Type text at the current focus.\n}\n\ninterface DomCUAAPI {\n  click(options: DomClickOptions): Promise<void>; // Click a DOM node by its id from the visible DOM snapshot.\n  double_click(options: DomClickOptions): Promise<void>; // Double-click a DOM node by its id.\n  \n  get_visible_dom(): Promise<unknown>; // Return a filtered DOM with node ids for interactable elements.\n  keypress(options: DomKeypressOptions): Promise<void>; // Press control characters at the currently focused element (focus it first via click/dblclick).\n  scroll(options: DomScrollOptions): Promise<void>; // Scroll either the page or a specific node (if node_id provided) by deltas.\n  type(options: DomTypeOptions): Promise<void>; // Type text into the currently focused element (focus via click first).\n}\n\ninterface PlaywrightAPI {\n  domSnapshot(): Promise<string>; // Return a snapshot of the current DOM as a string, including expanded iframe body content when available.\n\n  evaluate<TResult, TArg>(pageFunction: PlaywrightEvaluateFunction<TArg, TResult>, arg?: TArg, options?: PlaywrightEvaluateOptions): Promise<TResult>; // Evaluate JavaScript in a read-only page scope.\n  expectNavigation<T>(action: () => Promise<T>, options: { timeoutMs?: number; url?: string; waitUntil?: LoadState }): Promise<T>; // Expect a navigation triggered by an action.\n  frameLocator(frameSelector: string): PlaywrightFrameLocator; // Create a frame-scoped locator builder.\n  getByLabel(text: TextMatcher, options: { exact?: boolean }): PlaywrightLocator; // Find elements by label text within the page.\n  getByPlaceholder(text: TextMatcher, options: { exact?: boolean }): PlaywrightLocator; // Find elements by placeholder text within the page.\n  getByRole(role: string, options: { exact?: boolean; name?: TextMatcher }): PlaywrightLocator; // Find elements by ARIA role within the page.\n  getByTestId(testId: string): PlaywrightLocator; // Find elements by test id within the page.\n  getByText(text: TextMatcher, options: { exact?: boolean }): PlaywrightLocator; // Find elements by text within the page.\n  locator(selector: string): PlaywrightLocator; // Create a locator scoped to this tab.\n  waitForEvent(event: \"download\", options?: WaitForEventOptions): Promise<PlaywrightDownload>; // Wait for the next event on the page.\n\n  waitForLoadState(options: PageWaitForLoadStateOptions): Promise<void>; // Wait for the page to reach a specific load state.\n  waitForTimeout(timeoutMs: number): Promise<void>; // Wait for a fixed duration.\n  waitForURL(url: string, options: PageWaitForURLOptions): Promise<void>; // Wait for the page URL to match the provided value.\n}\n\ninterface PlaywrightFrameLocator {\n  frameLocator(frameSelector: string): PlaywrightFrameLocator; // Create a locator scoped to a nested frame.\n  getByLabel(text: TextMatcher, options: { exact?: boolean }): PlaywrightLocator; // Find elements by label within this frame.\n  getByPlaceholder(text: TextMatcher, options: { exact?: boolean }): PlaywrightLocator; // Find elements by placeholder within this frame.\n  getByRole(role: string, options: { exact?: boolean; name?: TextMatcher }): PlaywrightLocator; // Find elements by ARIA role within this frame.\n  getByTestId(testId: string): PlaywrightLocator; // Find elements by test id within this frame.\n  getByText(text: TextMatcher, options: { exact?: boolean }): PlaywrightLocator; // Find elements by text within this frame.\n  locator(selector: string): PlaywrightLocator; // Create a locator scoped to this frame.\n}\n\ninterface PlaywrightLocator {\n  all(): Promise<Array<PlaywrightLocator>>; // Resolve to a list of locators for each matched element.\n  allTextContents(options: { timeoutMs?: number }): Promise<Array<string>>; // Return `textContent` for *all* elements matched by this locator.\n  and(locator: PlaywrightLocator): PlaywrightLocator; // Return a locator matching elements that satisfy both this locator and `locator`.\n  check(options: LocatorCheckOptions): Promise<void>; // Check a checkbox or switch-like control.\n  click(options: LocatorClickOptions): Promise<void>; // Click the element matched by this locator.\n  count(): Promise<number>; // Number of elements matching this locator.\n  dblclick(options: LocatorClickOptions): Promise<void>; // Double-click the element matched by this locator.\n  downloadMedia(options: LocatorDownloadMediaOptions): Promise<void>; // Trigger a media download for the first matched element.\n  fill(value: string, options: { timeoutMs?: number }): Promise<void>; // Replace the element's value with the provided text.\n  filter(options: LocatorFilterOptions): PlaywrightLocator; // Narrow this locator by additional constraints.\n  first(): PlaywrightLocator; // Return a locator pointing at the first matched element.\n  getAttribute(name: string, options: { timeoutMs?: number }): Promise<null | string>; // Return an attribute value from the first matched element.\n  getByLabel(text: TextMatcher, options: { exact?: boolean }): PlaywrightLocator; // Find elements by label text, scoped to this locator.\n  getByPlaceholder(text: TextMatcher, options: { exact?: boolean }): PlaywrightLocator; // Find elements by placeholder text, scoped to this locator.\n  getByRole(role: string, options: { exact?: boolean; name?: TextMatcher }): PlaywrightLocator; // Find elements by ARIA role, scoped to this locator.\n  getByTestId(testId: string): PlaywrightLocator; // Find elements by test id, scoped to this locator.\n  getByText(text: TextMatcher, options: { exact?: boolean }): PlaywrightLocator; // Find elements by text content, scoped to this locator.\n  innerText(options: { timeoutMs?: number }): Promise<string>; // Return the rendered (visible) text of the first matched element.\n  isEnabled(): Promise<boolean>; // Whether the first matched element is currently enabled.\n  isVisible(): Promise<boolean>; // Whether the first matched element is currently visible.\n  last(): PlaywrightLocator; // Return a locator pointing at the last matched element.\n  locator(selector: string, options: LocatorLocatorOptions): PlaywrightLocator; // Create a descendant locator scoped to this locator.\n  nth(index: number): PlaywrightLocator; // Return a locator pointing at the Nth matched element.\n  or(locator: PlaywrightLocator): PlaywrightLocator; // Return a locator matching elements that satisfy either this locator or `locator`.\n  press(value: string, options: { timeoutMs?: number }): Promise<void>; // Press a keyboard key while this locator is focused.\n  selectOption(value: SelectOptionInput | Array<SelectOptionInput>, options: { timeoutMs?: number }): Promise<void>; // Select one or more options on a native `<select>` element.\n  setChecked(checked: boolean, options: LocatorCheckOptions): Promise<void>; // Set a checkbox or switch-like control to a checked/unchecked state.\n  textContent(options: { timeoutMs?: number }): Promise<null | string>; // Return the raw textContent of the first matched element (or null if missing).\n  type(value: string, options: { timeoutMs?: number }): Promise<void>; // Type text into the element without clearing existing content.\n  uncheck(options: LocatorCheckOptions): Promise<void>; // Uncheck a checkbox or switch-like control.\n  waitFor(options: LocatorWaitForOptions): Promise<void>; // Wait for the element to reach a specific state.\n}\n\ninterface PlaywrightDownload {\n\n}\n\ninterface TabClipboardAPI {\n  read(): Promise<Array<TabClipboardItem>>; // Read clipboard items, including text and binary payloads.\n  readText(): Promise<string>; // Read plain text from the browser clipboard.\n  write(items: Array<TabClipboardItem>): Promise<void>; // Write clipboard items.\n  writeText(text: string): Promise<void>; // Write plain text to the browser clipboard.\n}\n\ninterface TabDevAPI {\n  logs(options: TabDevLogsOptions): Promise<Array<TabDevLogEntry>>; // Read console log messages captured for this tab.\n}\n\ninterface AlertDialog {\n  type: \"alert\";\n  dismiss(): Promise<void>;\n}\n\ninterface BeforeUnloadDialog {\n  type: \"beforeunload\";\n  dismiss(): Promise<void>;\n}\n\ninterface ConfirmDialog {\n  type: \"confirm\";\n  accept(): Promise<void>;\n  dismiss(): Promise<void>;\n}\n\ninterface Documentation {\n  get(name: string): Promise<string>; // Read packaged documentation by its extensionless relative path.\n}\n\ninterface PromptDialog {\n  type: \"prompt\";\n  accept(text: string): Promise<void>;\n  dismiss(): Promise<void>;\n}\n\ntype BrowserCapabilityCollection = {\n  get(id: string): Promise<unknown>;\n  list(): Promise<Array<{ id: string; description: string }>>;\n};\n\ninterface BrowserUserTabInfo {\n  id: string; // Opaque identifier for this browser tab.\n  lastOpened?: string; // ISO 8601 timestamp for the last time the tab was opened or focused.\n  tabGroup?: string; // User-visible tab group name when the tab belongs to one.\n  title?: string; // User-visible tab title.\n  url?: string; // Current tab URL.\n}\n\ninterface TabsContentOptions {\n\n  timeoutMs?: number; // Maximum time to wait for each page load, in milliseconds.\n  urls: Array<string>; // URLs to load in temporary background tabs.\n}\n\ninterface TabsContentResult {\n\n  title: null | string; // The resolved page title when available.\n  url: string; // The resolved page URL when available, otherwise the requested URL.\n}\n\ninterface FinalizeTabsOptions {\n  keep?: Array<FinalizeTabsKeep>; // Explicit tab dispositions to preserve after cleanup.\n}\n\ninterface TabInfo {\n  id: string; // Metadata describing an open tab.\n  title?: string;\n  url?: string;\n}\n\ntype TabCapabilityCollection = {\n  get(id: string): Promise<unknown>;\n  list(): Promise<Array<{ id: string; description: string }>>;\n};\n\ntype Dialog = AlertDialog | BeforeUnloadDialog | ConfirmDialog | PromptDialog;\n\ntype ScreenshotOptions = {\n  clip?: ClipRect; // Crop to a specific rectangle instead of the full viewport.\n  fullPage?: boolean; // Capture the full page instead of the viewport.\n};\n\ntype ClickOptions = {\n  button?: number; // Mouse button (1-left, 2-middle/wheel, 3-right, 4-back, 5-forward).\n  keypress?: Array<string>; // Modifier keys held during the click.\n  x: number;\n  y: number;\n};\n\ntype DoubleClickOptions = {\n  keypress?: Array<string>; // Modifier keys held during the double click.\n  x: number;\n  y: number;\n};\n\ntype DragOptions = {\n  keys?: Array<string>; // Optional modifier keys held during the drag.\n  path: Array<{ x: number; y: number }>; // Drag path as a list of points.\n};\n\ntype KeypressOptions = {\n  keys: Array<string>; // Key combination to press.\n};\n\ntype MoveOptions = {\n  keys?: Array<string>; // Optional modifier keys held while moving.\n  x: number;\n  y: number;\n};\n\ntype ScrollOptions = {\n  keypress?: Array<string>; // Modifier keys held during scroll.\n  scrollX: number;\n  scrollY: number;\n  x: number;\n  y: number;\n};\n\ntype TypeOptions = {\n  text: string;\n};\n\ntype DomClickOptions = {\n  node_id: string; // Node id from `get_visible_dom()`.\n};\n\ntype DomKeypressOptions = {\n  keys: Array<string>; // Key combination to press.\n};\n\ntype DomScrollOptions = {\n  node_id?: string; // Optional node id to scroll within.\n  x: number; // Horizontal scroll delta.\n  y: number; // Vertical scroll delta.\n};\n\ntype DomTypeOptions = {\n  text: string; // Text to type into the currently focused element.\n};\n\ntype ElementInfoOptions = {\n  includeNonInteractable?: boolean; // When true, include non-interactable elements in addition to interactable targets.\n  x: number;\n  y: number;\n};\n\ntype ElementInfo = {\n  ariaName?: string | null; // Accessible name if available.\n  boundingBox?: ElementInfoRect | null; // Element bounds in screenshot coordinates.\n  nodeId?: number | null; // Backend node id that can be passed to DOM-inspection APIs when available.\n  preview: string; // Compact human-readable node preview.\n  role?: string | null; // Computed ARIA role if available.\n  selector: ElementInfoSelector; // Suggested selector data for this element.\n  tagName: string; // Lowercased HTML tag name.\n  testId?: string | null; // Configured test id attribute if present.\n  visibleText?: string | null; // Rendered visible text, selected option text, or visible form value when available.\n};\n\ntype ElementScreenshotOptions = {\n  includeNonInteractable?: boolean; // When true, highlight non-interactable elements in addition to interactable targets.\n  x: number;\n  y: number;\n};\n\ntype PlaywrightEvaluateFunction<TArg, TResult> = string | (arg: TArg) => TResult | Promise<TResult>;\n\ntype PlaywrightEvaluateOptions = {\n  timeoutMs?: number; // Maximum time to spend setting up the read-only DOM scope and running the script.\n};\n\ntype LoadState = \"load\" | \"domcontentloaded\" | \"networkidle\";\n\ntype TextMatcher = string | RegExp;\n\ntype WaitForEventOptions = {\n  timeoutMs?: number;\n};\n\ntype PageWaitForLoadStateOptions = {\n  state?: LoadState;\n  timeoutMs?: number;\n};\n\ntype PageWaitForURLOptions = {\n  timeoutMs?: number;\n  waitUntil?: WaitUntil;\n};\n\ntype LocatorCheckOptions = {\n  force?: boolean;\n  timeoutMs?: number;\n};\n\ntype LocatorClickOptions = {\n  button?: MouseButton;\n  force?: boolean;\n  modifiers?: Array<KeyboardModifier>;\n  timeoutMs?: number;\n};\n\ntype LocatorDownloadMediaOptions = {\n  timeoutMs?: number;\n};\n\ntype LocatorFilterOptions = {\n  has?: PlaywrightLocator;\n  hasNot?: PlaywrightLocator;\n  hasNotText?: TextMatcher;\n  hasText?: TextMatcher;\n  visible?: boolean;\n};\n\ntype LocatorLocatorOptions = {\n  has?: PlaywrightLocator;\n  hasNot?: PlaywrightLocator;\n  hasNotText?: TextMatcher;\n  hasText?: TextMatcher;\n};\n\ntype SelectOptionInput = string | SelectOptionDescriptor;\n\ntype LocatorWaitForOptions = {\n  state: WaitForState;\n  timeoutMs?: number;\n};\n\ntype TabClipboardItem = {\n  entries: Array<TabClipboardEntry>;\n  presentationStyle?: \"unspecified\" | \"inline\" | \"attachment\";\n};\n\ninterface TabDevLogsOptions {\n  filter?: string; // Optional substring filter applied to the rendered log message.\n  levels?: Array<\"debug\" | \"info\" | \"log\" | \"warn\" | \"error\" | \"warning\">; // Optional levels to include.\n  limit?: number; // Maximum number of logs to return.\n}\n\ninterface TabDevLogEntry {\n  level: \"debug\" | \"info\" | \"log\" | \"warn\" | \"error\"; // Console log level.\n  message: string; // Rendered log message text.\n  timestamp: string; // ISO 8601 timestamp for when the runtime captured the log.\n  url?: string; // Source URL reported by the browser runtime, when available.\n}\n\ntype TabsContentType = \"html\" | \"text\" | \"domSnapshot\";\n\ninterface FinalizeTa